{"type":"message","id":"84507e22","parentId":"549be1d9","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:07:34.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the problem clearly. The monitor is running, but there are massive SSL errors across all connections:\n\n1. **Binance Testnet API** - `SSL: UNEXPECTED_EOF_WHILE_READING` errors\n2. **Feishu API** - Same SSL error\n3. **DeepSeek API** - Same SSL error\n\nThe root cause is almost certainly the Clash proxy. All HTTPS connections through the proxy are getting SSL EOF errors. Let me check the Clash proxy status.\n\nThe key log lines:\n- `❌ 获取飞书 token 异常：...SSLEOFError(8, '[SSL: UNEXPECTED_EOF_WHILE_READING]'`\n- `⚠️ 飞书 token 缺失，跳过推送`\n- All Binance API calls failing with the same SSL error\n- But interestingly, after 07:04, some connections started working again (price updates, feishu push succeeded at 07:04:50)\n\nSo it seems intermittent - sometimes the proxy works, sometimes it doesn't. Let me check the Clash status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_2OwXsQlUs72TelBLsLJ17696","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -x http://127.0.0.1:7890 -s --connect-timeout 5 https://api.deepseek.com/v1/models -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_JhWodnc79lvuyeFmFgpI5797","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -x http://127.0.0.1:7890 -s --connect-timeout 5 https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal -X POST -d '{\"app_id\":\"test\",\"app_secret\":\"test\"}' -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code} %{ssl_verify_result}' 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_5pnwNDByTngNzHR6K7886427","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -x http://127.0.0.1:7890 -s --connect-timeout 5 https://testnet.binancefuture.com/fapi/v1/ping -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code} %{ssl_verify_result}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":11366,"output":760,"cacheRead":21888,