\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:26.97337056+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42214 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:28.372634882+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42218 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:29.690763007+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42222 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:30.932183214+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42226 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:32.381556599+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42230 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:33.744654307+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42234 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"\ntime=\"2026-05-27T07:07:35.213022536+08:00\" level=info msg=\"[TCP] 127.0.0.1:42238 --> testnet.binancefuture.com:443 match DomainSuffix(binancefuture.com) using PROXY[HK-Home-03]\"","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779836860482}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b40e95b","parentId":"e8ec228b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:07:56.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture:\n\n1. At 07:00-07:04, nodes `xg1.kunlun01.com:18000` on IP `103.182.96.231` were failing with \"connect: network is unreachable\"\n2. Clash then did an active health check and switched to a different node `HK-Home-03`\n3. After the switch at ~07:04:44, everything started working again - Binance API, Feishu, and price updates all came back\n\nThe problem is:\n- The proxy node `xg1.kunlun01.com:18000` at IP `103.182.96.231` is unreliable - sometimes the network is unreachable\n- When that node fails, Clash needs multiple failures before it triggers a health check and switches nodes\n- During that window of node failure (could be several minutes), ALL external connections break: Binance, Feishu, DeepSeek\n- This causes the monitor to miss push cycles and fail API calls\n\nThe root cause: Unreliable proxy nodes in the subscription, combined with Clash's failover delay.\n\nWhat the user means by \"还是没有轮询推送\" (still no polling push) - the monitor IS running and trying, but during the proxy node failure windows, both the Binance API calls fail AND the Feishu push fails. The Feishu hour report at 07:04 actually succeeded once Clash switched to a working node.\n\nKey evidence:\n- `⚠️ 飞书 token 缺失，跳过推送` at 07:00:36 and 07:01:50\n- `✅ 飞书推送成功` at 07:04:50\n- Clash log: `xg1.kunlun01.com:18000 connect error: connect failed: dial tcp 103.182.96.231:18000: connect: network is unreachable`\n- Clash log: health check then switched to `HK-Home-03` at ~07:04:44\n\nThis is an intermittent proxy node issue. The monitor is running fine - when the proxy works, everything works. When it doesn't, everything breaks.\n\nI should tell the user what's happening clearly: the Clash proxy nodes are unstable, specifically the xg1.kunlun01.com node keeps going unreachable, and when it does, all external connections die until Clash's health check switches to a backup node. This explains why sometimes you get pushes and sometimes you don't.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"老公，看了日志，找到原因了。\n\n**不是 monitor 没跑，是 Clash 代理节点间歇性挂掉**\n\n从 Clash 日志看到：\n- 07:00~07:04 节点 `xg1.kunlun01.com` 反复报 `connect: network is unreachable`（目标 IP 103.182.96.231:18000 不可达）\n- 这期间所有 HTTPS 请求全炸 — Binance API、飞书 token、DeepSeek 统统 SSL EOF\n- monitor 也在 07:00 和 07:01 两次尝试推飞书，都因为拿不到 token 跳过了（`飞书 token 缺失，跳过推送`）\n- 直到 07:04 Clash 健康检查触发，切到备用节点 `HK-Home-03`，之后立刻就恢复了 — 飞书推送成功、价格全拉回来\n\n**总结：不是你看到的\"没轮询\"，而是代理节点挂了那 4 分钟，monitor 的所有出站请求全部失败，等 Clash 自动切节点后才恢复。**\n\n你的订阅源里那几个节点不太稳，要不要我看看 Clash 配置里能不能调一下健康检查频率或者把不稳定的节点优先级降下去？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":8257,"output":1322,"cacheRead":33920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43499,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779836860492}}
