{"type":"message","id":"f7c24817","parentId":"467cfae4","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:11:25.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Clear now. DOT tried to open a SHORT position twice:\n1. At 06:52-06:53 → Failed (proxy down)\n2. At 07:00-07:01 → Failed again (proxy down)\n\nBoth attempts failed due to SSL errors during the proxy outage window. DOT has a 300-second cooldown, so it won't try again until ~07:07. But even then, the signal might have changed.\n\nDOT was never actually in a position - both open attempts failed because Clash proxy was down. The user might have thought DOT was open from earlier, but it never successfully opened.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"DOT 根本没开仓成功，所以不存在\"没了\"这个说法。\n\n在你前面问到的那 4 分钟代理挂掉窗口里，DOT 连着两次尝试开空都失败了（06:53 一次、07:01 一次），全部 SSL EOF 报错。monitor 记录的是 `❌ DOT 开仓失败，已记录冷却 300 秒` — 单子根本没发到币安。\n\n现在持仓里应该有 2 个其他币种，DOT 还在 300 秒冷却期内，等下轮信号才会再评估。代理现在恢复了，再触发应该能正常开了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1345,"output":395,"cacheRead":44416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46156,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779837079139}}
