{"type":"message","id":"9b3bd762","parentId":"9c50638c","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:28.234Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see it! Line 2373: `tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, ind, pd)` - this is where the SL/TP is calculated for new positions. It's using `calc_tp_sl()` which has the 2% SL.\n\nBut wait - the current SOL and LINK positions have SL at ~1%, not 2%. So either:\n1. The positions were opened BEFORE the 2% change was made, or\n2. The `calc_tp_sl()` function was recently changed to 2% but the Algo orders on Binance still reflect the old 1% values\n\nLet me check when SOL and LINK were opened and compare with when the change was made.\n\nActually, looking at the code more carefully, `calc_tp_sl()` creates the tp_sl dict, but the Algo orders might be using something else. Let me look at the function that actually submits the Algo orders.\n\nWait, looking at lines 2373-2374:\n```python\ntp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, ind, pd)\npos = open_position(sym, direction, entry, score, tp_sl, regime, ai_result)\n```\n\nAnd in `open_position()`:\n```python\ntp_price=tp_sl.get(\"tp1_price\"),\nsl_price=tp_sl.get(\"sl_price\"),\n```\n\nSo the Algo orders ARE using `calc_tp_sl()` which gives 2% SL. But the actual opened positions have ~1% SL. This is contradictory.\n\nLet me check the `calc_tp_sl` function more carefully to see if it has two paths - one for the fixed 2% and one for the dynamic calculation.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_rnlrQzie3IrV1Zi5pb0F3104","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sed -n '562,600p' ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":287,"output":794,"cacheRead":83072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84153,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779837919930}}
{"type":"message","id":"70e95de7","parentId":"9b3bd762","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:28.384Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_rnlrQzie3IrV1Zi5pb0F3104","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：固定百分比止盈止损 + 全平\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：-2%\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    STOP_LOSS_PCT   = 0.02  # 2%\n    \n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做多 +4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做多 -2%\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做空 -4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做空 +2%\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":88,"aggregated":"def calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：固定百分比止盈止损 + 全平\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：-2%\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    STOP_LOSS_PCT   = 0.02  # 2%\n    \n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做多 +4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做多 -2%\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做空 -4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做空 +2%\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\ndef check_exits_fast(positions: list, prices: dict) -> list[tuple]:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 [(position, reason, close_size_ratio)]\n    纯价格比较，无任何计算，<5ms","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779837928375}}
{"type":"message","id":"3ae778bf","parentId":"70e95de7","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:37.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so `calc_tp_sl()` DOES use 2% SL. But the actual positions have:\n- SOL: entry $84.13, SL $84.97 → ($84.97 - $84.13) / $84.13 = 1.0%\n- LINK: entry $9.421, SL $9.52 → ($9.52 - $9.421) / $9.421 = 1.05%\n\nNeither is 2%. So there's a disconnect. The Algo orders on Binance show 1%, not 2%.\n\nWait, maybe the positions were opened with an older version of `calc_tp_sl()` that had 1% SL, and then the code was updated to 2% but the existing Algo orders remain at the old 1% level.\n\nActually, looking at the timestamps:\n- SOL opened: 2026-05-27 00:12:28\n- LINK opened: 2026-05-27 00:13:52\n\nThese were opened TODAY. And the code shows 2% SL. But the Algo orders show ~1%. That's a bug.\n\nLet me verify: what SL would 2% give?\n- SOL: $84.13 * 1.02 = $85.81 → but Algo shows $84.97\n- LINK: $9.421 * 1.02 = $9.609 → but Algo shows $9.52\n\nThe actual SL values ($84.97 and $9.52) are NOT 2%. They seem to be from the OLD dynamic formula.\n\nLet me check if there's ANOTHER place where SL is calculated differently, perhaps in the `place_order` function or the Algo submission.\n\nActually, wait. Let me look at the `place_order` function from `binance_auto_trade` module to see if it recalculates SL internally.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_bqYR8PGHDZHN4KBSkFhC8916","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'def place_order\\|sl_price\\|stop_loss\\|STOP_LOSS\\|sl_pct' ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":508,"output":891,"cacheRead":83712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85111,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779837928392}}
