{"type":"message","id":"62b24da9","parentId":"77ddc4be","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:44.453Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_coKU2XEUO3gHUHAZYpDt0201","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def place_algo_conditional_order(\n    symbol: str,\n    side: str,\n    order_type: str,\n    trigger_price,\n    working_type: str = \"MARK_PRICE\",\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    币安 USD-M 条件单（2025-12 起须走 Algo API，否则 -4120）\n\n    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n    side: 平仓方向 — 平多 SELL，平空 BUY\n    \"\"\"\n    params = {\n        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": order_type,\n        \"triggerPrice\": format_price(trigger_price),\n        \"closePosition\": \"true\",\n        \"workingType\": working_type,\n    }\n    return request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", params)\n\n\ndef check_margin_ratio_protection():\n    \"\"\"\n    爆仓保护检查\n    保证金率低于 5% 立即平仓所有持仓\n    \"\"\"\n    margin_ratio = get_margin_ratio()\n    threshold = RISK.get(\"margin_ratio_warning\", 0.05)\n    \n    if margin_ratio < threshold:\n        log.warning(f\"🚨 爆仓保护触发！保证金率={margin_ratio:.4f} < {threshold:.4f}\")"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":122,"aggregated":"def place_algo_conditional_order(\n    symbol: str,\n    side: str,\n    order_type: str,\n    trigger_price,\n    working_type: str = \"MARK_PRICE\",\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    币安 USD-M 条件单（2025-12 起须走 Algo API，否则 -4120）\n\n    order_type: STOP_MARKET（止损）| TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET（止盈）\n    side: 平仓方向 — 平多 SELL，平空 BUY\n    \"\"\"\n    params = {\n        \"algoType\": \"CONDITIONAL\",\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": order_type,\n        \"triggerPrice\": format_price(trigger_price),\n        \"closePosition\": \"true\",\n        \"workingType\": working_type,\n    }\n    return request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/algoOrder\", params)\n\n\ndef check_margin_ratio_protection():\n    \"\"\"\n    爆仓保护检查\n    保证金率低于 5% 立即平仓所有持仓\n    \"\"\"\n    margin_ratio = get_margin_ratio()\n    threshold = RISK.get(\"margin_ratio_warning\", 0.05)\n    \n    if margin_ratio < threshold:\n        log.warning(f\"🚨 爆仓保护触发！保证金率={margin_ratio:.4f} < {threshold:.4f}\")","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779837944444}}
{"type":"message","id":"24686ef3","parentId":"62b24da9","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:44.469Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_AmA3qHfyiDLvILjRu4LE3060","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"order_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n    \n    # 主单失败时直接返回，不要再下 SL/TP（避免无主单的孤儿挂单）\n    main_order_ok = isinstance(order_result, dict) and bool(order_result.get(\"orderId\"))\n    if not main_order_ok:\n        log.error(f\"🔴 {symbol} 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{order_result}\")\n    \n    # 3. 设置止盈止损（Algo Order API，避免 -4120）\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_sl:\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n        )\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_sl} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止损单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_tp:\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n        )\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_tp} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止盈单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    \n    # 检查订单是否成功（严格判断：必须有 orderId）\n    # 🐛 2026-04-27 修复：原 `\"code\" in str(order_result)` 判断在某些 Binance 字段\n    #     里可能误判（如未来新增字段名含 code），改为「正向判断有 orderId」\n    order_success = False\n    order_msg = \"\"\n    \n    if isinstance(order_result, dict):\n        if order_result.get(\"orderId\"):\n            order_success = True"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":84,"aggregated":"order_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n    \n    # 主单失败时直接返回，不要再下 SL/TP（避免无主单的孤儿挂单）\n    main_order_ok = isinstance(order_result, dict) and bool(order_result.get(\"orderId\"))\n    if not main_order_ok:\n        log.error(f\"🔴 {symbol} 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{order_result}\")\n    \n    # 3. 设置止盈止损（Algo Order API，避免 -4120）\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_sl:\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n        )\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_sl} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止损单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_tp:\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n        )\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_tp} algoId={tp_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止盈单提交失败：{tp_result}\")\n    \n    # 检查订单是否成功（严格判断：必须有 orderId）\n    # 🐛 2026-04-27 修复：原 `\"code\" in str(order_result)` 判断在某些 Binance 字段\n    #     里可能误判（如未来新增字段名含 code），改为「正向判断有 orderId」\n    order_success = False\n    order_msg = \"\"\n    \n    if isinstance(order_result, dict):\n        if order_result.get(\"orderId\"):\n            order_success = True","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779837944460}}
{"type":"message","id":"352f605f","parentId":"24686ef3","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:25:49.446Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the `place_order` function passes `sl_price` directly to the Algo order API. It uses `format_price(sl_price)` to format the price.\n\nNow I need to understand: where does the tp_sl come from for new positions? Line 2373:\n```python\ntp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, ind, pd)\n```\n\nAnd `calc_tp_sl` returns 2% SL. So for:\n- SOL entry $84.13, SL should be $84.13 * 1.02 = $85.81\n- LINK entry $9.421, SL should be $9.421 * 1.02 = $9.609\n\nBut the actual Algo orders were at $84.97 and $9.52. That's NOT 2%.\n\nLet me check if `format_price` or `format_quantity` is modifying the SL price:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_B0S8b1tlleWaWvmSikRk6669","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'def format_price\\|def format_quantity' ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":905,"output":459,"cacheRead":85376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86740,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779837944475}}
