rrect and offer the restart.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"源码里 `calc_tp_sl()` 已经是固定 2% 了，问题是老进程没重启所以没生效。\n\n不过我可以直接把币安上 SOL 和 LINK 现有的 ~1% Algo 止损单换成 2%，这样不用重启，这两笔持仓立刻就按 2% 保护。要换吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":167,"output":2113,"cacheRead":92800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95080,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779838126167}}
