{"type":"message","id":"f7890e92","parentId":"4c38acbb","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:31:33.678Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if they need to run `kj` to restart. I should confirm yes - that's the simplest way. A restart will load the new code with 2% SL, and the position sync logic at line 2048-2067 will recalculate the SL/TP for existing positions using `calc_tp_sl()` which has 2%.\n\nSo after restart:\n1. Monitor loads new code with 2% SL\n2. Position sync recalculates SOL/LINK SL to 2%  \n3. Old Algo orders get cancelled and new ones submitted at 2%\n\nThis is cleaner than manually patching Algo orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"对，`kj` 重启就行。重启后 monitor 会自动同步持仓，用新的 `calc_tp_sl()` 把现有的 SOL 和 LINK 止损都更新到 2%，旧 Algo 单会自动取消换新的 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":488,"output":321,"cacheRead":93952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94761,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779838287378}}
