{"type":"message","id":"faf703ef","parentId":"9829753e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:32:23.539Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the lack of polling/push notifications is also because the monitor hasn't been restarted. Let me think about this.\n\nFrom earlier analysis, the push issue was caused by Clash proxy nodes being intermittently unreachable, not by the monitor not being restarted. The monitor IS running and tries to push, but during proxy outage windows, the Feishu API call fails because it can't get through the proxy.\n\nSo the push failures are a proxy issue, not a code/restart issue. The restart would only fix the SL% calculation, not the proxy reliability problem.\n\nBut the user seems to think these might be related. Let me clarify.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不是，推送问题是 Clash 代理节点不稳定导致的，跟重启没关系。\n\n之前分析过了：代理节点 `xg1.kunlun01.com` 间歇性不可达，那段时间所有出站 HTTPS 全挂（Binance、飞书、DeepSeek），飞书 token 拿不到就跳过了推送。等 Clash 自动切到备用节点 `HK-Home-03` 后就恢复了。\n\n重启 monitor 只解决止损比例（1%→2%），推送稳不稳还是看代理。想彻底解决推送问题的话，得换个稳定的订阅源或者调整 Clash 的健康检查频率 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":533,"output":407,"cacheRead":94336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95276,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779838334604}}
