{"type":"message","id":"a43945d3","parentId":"3b86fa27","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:45:40.186Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why OpenClaw, which supposedly supports hot-reload/deployment, still requires manual restart of the crypto monitor scripts. \n\nOpenClaw itself might support hot-reloading for its own configuration, but the crypto monitor scripts are standalone Python processes that are launched once and keep running. Python loads modules at startup - it doesn't automatically detect file changes and reload. The `kj` script starts these processes as separate background processes, not as part of OpenClaw's own runtime.\n\nSo the answer is: OpenClaw gateway itself might hot-reload, but the crypto scripts (crypto_signal_monitor.py, watchdog) are independent Python processes started by `kj`, and Python doesn't hot-reload by default.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw 自身（网关、插件、配置）是热部署的，但 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 是独立的 Python 常驻进程，由 `kj` 脚本 `nohup` 启动的，跟 OpenClaw 不在同一个运行时里。\n\nPython 进程启动时就把所有模块加载到内存了，改文件不会自动重载，必须 kill 旧进程重新跑才生效。\n\n可以让 `kj` 加个文件监控自动重启，或者让 monitor 本身支持 `importlib.reload` 热加载配置。要搞吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":362,"output":423,"cacheRead":100480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101265,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779839130930}}
{"type":"message","id":"d26c5217","parentId":"a43945d3","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:46:33.400Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e5743447ca8b258c92a2b73754\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 07:46 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e5743447ca8b258c92a2b73754]\n用户124241: 看门狗没上班吗"}],"timestamp":1779839193370}}
{"type":"message","id":"12ccd6a1","parentId":"d26c5217","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:46:37.251Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why the watchdog didn't detect that the monitor was running old code and automatically restart it. Let me check what the watchdog actually does - it might only check process health (is it running?) not code freshness.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Kcsmhwrvo19nTJdQTCu58018","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"head -60 ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_monitor_watchdog.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":513,"output":155,"cacheRead":100736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101404,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779839193392}}
{"type":"message","id":"a5d7b46f","parentId":"12ccd6a1","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:46:37.468Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_Kcsmhwrvo19nTJdQTCu58018","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\n加密货币监控脚本看门狗（智能版）\n- 检测到进程未运行时自动启动\n- 通过 PID 文件检查是否是 kj 正在启动\n- 避免重复启动导致的双进程问题\n\"\"\"\n\nimport subprocess\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport os\n\nSCRIPT_NAME = \"crypto_signal_monitor.py\"\nSCRIPT_PATH = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts\") / SCRIPT_NAME\nfrom openclaw_logging import append_log, current_log_path, trading_log_path\n\nLOG_FILE = current_log_path(\"watchdog\")\nPID_FILE = \"/tmp/crypto_monitor.pid\"\nLOCK_FILE = \"/tmp/crypto_monitor.lock\"\nCHECK_INTERVAL = 10  # 10 秒检查一次\nSTARTUP_WAIT = 15  # kj 启动后等待 15 秒\nLOG_MAINTENANCE_INTERVAL = 3600  # 日志维护提示间隔（与旧版「每小时清理」一致）\n_last_log_maintenance = 0.0\n\ndef log(message):\n    \"\"\"写日志\"\"\"\n    timestamp = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    log_line = f\"[{timestamp}] {message}\"\n    print(log_line)\n    try:\n        append_log(\"watchdog\", log_line)\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\ndef check_process():\n    \"\"\"检查主脚本是否运行\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            ['pgrep', '-f', SCRIPT_NAME],\n            capture_output=True,\n            text=True\n        )\n        pids = result.stdout.strip()\n        return bool(pids), pids\n    except:\n        return False, \"\"\n\ndef check_kj_is_starting():\n    \"\"\"检查 kj 是否正在启动（通过锁文件判断）\"\"\"\n    if os.path.exists(LOCK_FILE):\n        try:\n            # 尝试获取锁，如果失败说明 kj 正在运行\n            import fcntl\n            with open(LOCK_FILE) as f:\n                fcntl.flock(f.fileno(), fcntl.LOCK_EX | fcntl.LOCK_NB)\n                return False  # 能获取锁，说明 kj 没在运行\n        except:"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":99,"aggregated":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\n加密货币监控脚本看门狗（智能版）\n- 检测到进程未运行时自动启动\n- 通过 PID 文件检查是否是 kj 正在启动\n- 避免重复启动导致的双进程问题\n\"\"\"\n\nimport subprocess\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport os\n\nSCRIPT_NAME = \"crypto_signal_monitor.py\"\nSCRIPT_PATH = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts\") / SCRIPT_NAME\nfrom openclaw_logging import append_log, current_log_path, trading_log_path\n\nLOG_FILE = current_log_path(\"watchdog\")\nPID_FILE = \"/tmp/crypto_monitor.pid\"\nLOCK_FILE = \"/tmp/crypto_monitor.lock\"\nCHECK_INTERVAL = 10  # 10 秒检查一次\nSTARTUP_WAIT = 15  # kj 启动后等待 15 秒\nLOG_MAINTENANCE_INTERVAL = 3600  # 日志维护提示间隔（与旧版「每小时清理」一致）\n_last_log_maintenance = 0.0\n\ndef log(message):\n    \"\"\"写日志\"\"\"\n    timestamp = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    log_line = f\"[{timestamp}] {message}\"\n    print(log_line)\n    try:\n        append_log(\"watchdog\", log_line)\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\ndef check_process():\n    \"\"\"检查主脚本是否运行\"\"\"\n    try:\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            ['pgrep', '-f', SCRIPT_NAME],\n            capture_output=True,\n            text=True\n        )\n        pids = result.stdout.strip()\n        return bool(pids), pids\n    except:\n        return False, \"\"\n\ndef check_kj_is_starting():\n    \"\"\"检查 kj 是否正在启动（通过锁文件判断）\"\"\"\n    if os.path.exists(LOCK_FILE):\n        try:\n            # 尝试获取锁，如果失败说明 kj 正在运行\n            import fcntl\n            with open(LOCK_FILE) as f:\n                fcntl.flock(f.fileno(), fcntl.LOCK_EX | fcntl.LOCK_NB)\n                return False  # 能获取锁，说明 kj 没在运行\n        except:","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779839197436}}
{"type":"message","id":"28917ad8","parentId":"a5d7b46f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:46:42.864Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The watchdog only checks if the process is running (via pgrep), not whether the code is up to date. It monitors process health only - crash detection and auto-restart. It doesn't know about code changes.\n\nSo the user's question is valid - the watchdog was \"on duty\" but its job is just to restart if the process dies, not to detect stale code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看门狗只管进程死活——进程挂了自动拉起来。它不检查代码是不是旧版本，不会知道源码改了需要重启。\n\n目前它的逻辑就是 10 秒 `pgrep` 一次，进程在就不管。要加个文件修改时间检测吗？发现 .py 变了自动重启 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":613,"output":221,"cacheRead":101248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779839197481}}
