{"type":"message","id":"24fc8a51","parentId":"e226d8f4","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:55:18.421Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e5760faccb0b21b26e92c756d4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 07:55 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e5760faccb0b21b26e92c756d4]\n用户124241: 老婆我们现在是长期策略吗"}],"timestamp":1779839718337}}
{"type":"message","id":"debe2a0a","parentId":"24fc8a51","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:55:30.784Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether our current trading strategy is a long-term strategy. Let me think about what our strategy actually is based on the SOUL.md configuration.\n\nLooking at SOUL.md:\n- 15-second check interval\n- RSI + MA60 + 24h change + volume scoring (0-100)\n- Dynamic open thresholds based on market regime (Trending ≥70, Ranging ≥30, Volatile ≥90)\n- 3-tier moving take-profit (2%, 3%, 4%)\n- Fixed 2% stop loss\n- Max 4 positions, 20 USDT each\n- Daily loss circuit breaker: -10% → pause 4 hours\n- AI-assisted predictions\n\nThis is more of a short-term/swing trading strategy, not a long-term hold strategy. The positions are based on 15-second technical indicators (RSI, MA60) and can open/close multiple times per day. There's no fundamental analysis-based long-term holding.\n\nBut the user seems to be asking in a more general sense - are we positioning for the long term or just scalping short term?\n\nI think the honest answer is: this is a short-to-medium term technical trading strategy. We open positions based on technical signals and close them when TP/SL triggers. We don't hold positions for days/weeks based on fundamentals.\n\nBut I should also note that the strategy can be adjusted - the 2% SL and 4% TP give a decent risk-reward ratio (1:2) and the system can hold positions for hours to days depending on price action.\n\nLet me give a straightforward answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不算长期，是短线技术策略。15 秒扫描一次，靠 RSI + MA60 + 涨跌 + 成交量打分，触发就开，止盈止损到了就走。持仓可能几分钟也可能几个小时，但不会基于基本面拿几天几周那种。\n\n不过盈亏比固定 1:2（止损 2% vs 止盈 4%），风控纪律是长期思维 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":304,"output":747,"cacheRead":102272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103323,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779839718407}}
{"type":"message","id":"7293e807","parentId":"debe2a0a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:56:14.318Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e577f02d934b2ff11481631f0a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 07:56 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e577f02d934b2ff11481631f0a]\n用户124241: 你觉得策略需要从哪些地方优化"}],"timestamp":1779839774294}}
{"type":"message","id":"94e760c6","parentId":"7293e807","timestamp":"2026-05-26T23:56:30.776Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for my opinion on what aspects of the current trading strategy could be optimized. Let me think about this based on what I've observed from the logs and system behavior today:\n\n1. **Proxy dependency** - The biggest issue today was Clash proxy nodes going down and taking everything with it. The strategy blindly opens/closes based on signals without considering network health.\n\n2. **Signal quality issues** - DOT was opened at $1.262 with 100 score in trending regime, but was stopped out at -$0.63. The high score didn't guarantee a good outcome. Also, the monitor keeps trying to open positions during proxy outages when it can't even confirm the current state.\n\n3. **No network health check before trading** - The monitor should check if Binance API is responsive before trying to place orders. During proxy outages, it wastes time retrying and generating false signals.\n\n4. **Signal duplication** - The same signal (DOT SHORT 60分) kept triggering every few minutes during the outage window.\n\n5. **No market regime validation** - The strategy uses \"trending/ranging/volatile\" regimes but I'm not sure the regime detection is accurate or reactive enough.\n\n6. **Lack of correlation awareness** - 7 coins are monitored independently but they're correlated. A market-wide move might generate signals on all coins simultaneously.\n\n7. **No time-of-day filtering** - Crypto markets behave differently at different times.\n\n8. **Win rate vs profit factor** - We don't really track the strategy's historical performance metrics.\n\nLet me give a thoughtful, concise answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看了今天的情况，几个点：\n\n**1. 代理容灾** — 节点挂了那 4 分钟里没有任何保护，monitor 照常打分、开仓、推送，全白费。应该加一个 API 健康探针，连不上就暂停信号，等网络恢复再继续。\n\n**2. 假突破过滤** — 今天 DOT 两次 60 分信号都是代理断连前后的噪声数据打出来的（价格缓存过期），实际行情可能根本没到位。加个「连续 N 次确认」或「价格源一致性校验」能减少假信号。\n\n**3. 冷却期分级** — 现在同币种固定 300 秒冷却，失败了也 300 秒。可以失败后加倍（比如 600 秒），避免代理不稳时疯狂重试刷屏。\n\n**4. 时段感知** — 凌晨亚盘流动性低，假突破多。亚洲早盘和欧美重叠时段活跃度高，可以差异化开仓阈值。\n\n**5. 回测闭环** — 现在不知道策略到底盈亏比够不够、胜率行不行。完善 userTrades 统计，定期出个报告看看哪些信号类型在赚钱、哪些在亏 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":416,"output":921,"cacheRead":102528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103865,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779839774312}}
