{"type":"message","id":"1481b924","parentId":"fc203312","timestamp":"2026-05-27T00:02:19.280Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know which files to modify for each of the optimization points I suggested. Let me map each optimization to the relevant files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"按五个点对应：\n\n| 优化 | 文件 | 改什么 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| ① 代理容灾 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | 主循环里加 API 健康探针，`ping` 不通就 `sleep` 跳过本轮 |\n| ② 假突破过滤 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | 信号打分函数，加价格源一致性校验（WS 价格 vs REST API 价格偏差阈值） |\n| ③ 冷却期分级 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | `CooldownManager` 类，失败时 `cooldown * 2` |\n| ④ 时段感知 | `crypto_signal_monitor.py` | `CONFIG` 加时段阈值表，评分时根据 `datetime.now().hour` 调阈值 |\n| ⑤ 回测闭环 | `scripts/` 可能新增 `strategy_report.py` | 拉 `userTrades` 按信号类型/币种/时段统计胜率盈亏比 |\n\n基本都是改 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 一个文件，只有回测报告可能需要新脚本 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":569,"output":312,"cacheRead":102912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103793,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779840133675}}
