{"type":"message","id":"4c85f569","parentId":"c875d16c","timestamp":"2026-05-27T00:08:01.834Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the full .openclaw directory structure. Let me identify what's sensitive and should NOT go to git:\n\nSensitive (MUST exclude):\n- `/root/.openclaw/config.yaml` - contains API keys, tokens\n- `/root/.openclaw/crypto/.env` - crypto trading API keys\n- `/root/.openclaw/config/env.json` - environment config\n- `/root/.openclaw/credentials/` - feishu credentials\n- `/root/.openclaw/identity/` - device identity\n- `/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json` - contains passwords/secrets\n- `/root/.openclaw/gateway.env` - gateway environment variables\n- `/root/.openclaw/agents/main/agent/models.json` - agent model config\n- `/root/.openclaw/devices/` - device pairing data\n- `/root/.openclaw/subagents/runs.json` - subagent data\n- `/root/.openclaw/settings.json` - might contain secrets\n- `/root/.openclaw/exec-approvals.json` - execution approvals\n- `/root/.openclaw/completions/` - shell completions (not sensitive but generated)\n- `/root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/` - runtime queue\n\nRuntime/generated (should exclude):\n- `/root/.openclaw/logs/` - all logs\n- `/root/.openclaw/canvas/` - canvas HTML\n- `/root/.openclaw/flows/` - sqlite databases\n- `/root/.openclaw/tasks/` - sqlite databases\n- `/root/.openclaw/memory/main.sqlite` - runtime memory\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/logs/` - workspace logs\n- `/root/.openclaw/.claude/` - claude settings\n- `/root/.openclaw/CLAUDE.md` - claude config\n\nWhat SHOULD be in git:\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/` - the main workspace\n  - AGENTS.md, SOUL.md, USER.md, HEARTBEAT.md, IDENTITY.md, TOOLS.md\n  - memory/ (daily logs)\n  - docs/\n  - config/ (workspace config, not sensitive)\n  - scripts/ (all python scripts, but need to exclude logs, cache, tokens)\n- `/root/.openclaw/kj.sh` - startup script\n- `/root/.openclaw/extensions/` - OpenClaw extensions\n- `/root/.openclaw/plugins/` - plugins\n- `/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json` - cron jobs\n\nActually the user's question is broader - they want to know if .openclaw can be \"完整上传\" (fully uploaded). The answer is NO - there are too many sensitive files. But we can selectively upload the important code/config files.\n\nLet me think about what the best approach is:\n1. The git repo should be at `/root/.openclaw/` level (or `/root/.openclaw/workspace/`)\n2. Need a good .gitignore to exclude sensitive and runtime files\n3. The user's actual code is in `workspace/scripts/` and config files\n\nLet me present this clearly to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"不能全传，有很多敏感和运行时文件。分类说一下：\n\n**❌ 绝对不能上传：**\n- `config.yaml` / `crypto/.env` / `openclaw.json` — API 密钥、飞书 token\n- `credentials/` / `identity/` / `devices/` — 设备身份、配对接入凭证\n- `gateway.env` — 网关环境变量\n\n**❌ 没必要上传：**\n- `logs/` — 运行日志\n- `flows/` `tasks/` — sqlite 数据库\n- `memory/main.sqlite` — 运行时记忆\n- `__pycache__/` `node_modules/` — 编译/依赖产物\n\n**✅ 应该上传的：**\n- `workspace/` — 全部源码、策略、记忆、文档（排除 logs、缓存）\n- `kj.sh` — 一键启动脚本\n- `extensions/` `plugins/` — OpenClaw 扩展\n- `cron/jobs.json` — 定时任务\n- `canvas/` — 前端页面\n\n建议仓库建在 `/root/.openclaw/`，`.gitignore` 我已经有数了。要我直接动手吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":999,"output":1678,"cacheRead":106752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109429,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779840464628}}
