{"type":"message","id":"cad96303","parentId":"40482691","timestamp":"2026-05-27T00:10:21.912Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me review the conversation and capture the important durable memories from today's session.\n\nKey events today (2026-05-27):\n1. User reported no polling/push notifications for crypto monitor\n2. Diagnosed issue: Clash proxy node `xg1.kunlun01.com` intermittent failures, causing SSL EOF errors across Binance, Feishu, and DeepSeek APIs from ~07:00-07:04\n3. Clash auto-switched to backup node `HK-Home-03` at 07:04, then everything recovered\n4. User asked about current positions - SOL SHORT and LINK SHORT, DOT had been stopped out\n5. DOT trade history: opened SHORT at 00:13 @$1.262, stopped out at ~03:32 with -0.634 USDT loss\n6. User discovered SL was ~1% instead of the configured 2% - because monitor process (PID 27448) was running old code since June 2023\n7. User restarted monitor via `kj`, new process (PID 15217) started at 07:43, SL updated to 2% for both positions\n8. User asked about strategy optimization - discussed 5 areas: proxy resilience, fake breakout filtering, cooldown grading, timezone awareness, backtesting\n9. User asked about git version control - discovered existing git repo at https://github.com/yuki39lhl-huang/Morgan.git but wants a clean restart\n10. Discussed what can/cannot be uploaded to git from .openclaw directory\n\nLet me check if memory/2026-05-27.md already exists and append to it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_mwdtnS03CexmADITtRjO0995","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-27.md 2>/dev/null && echo \"EXISTS\" || echo \"NOT_EXISTS\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":105440,"output":784,"cacheRead":3584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109808,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRe