{"type":"compaction","id":"162cd39e","parentId":"5280c60c","timestamp":"2026-05-27T00:15:06.054Z","summary":"## Decisions\n- **Proxy instability is root cause**: Clash proxy node `xg1.kunlun01.com:18000` (IP `103.182.96.231`) intermittently goes unreachable, causing SSL EOF errors for all HTTPS connections (Binance, Feishu, DeepSeek) during 4-minute outage windows. Clash health check eventually switches to backup node `HK-Home-03`.\n- **2% is take-profit, not stop-loss**: User confused the 2% TP target from SOUL.md's 三档移动止盈 with the stop loss. Stop loss is dynamically calculated via formula `max(支撑位×0.995, 价格×(1-ATR×分层倍数), 24h低点×0.98)`, capped at ≤3%.\n\n## Open TODOs\n- [ ] Investigate/adjust Clash configuration to improve node health check frequency or deprioritize unstable nodes\n- [ ] User may want to adjust ATR分层倍数 to widen stop loss for low-volatility coins like DOT\n\n## Constraints/Rules\n- SOUL.md: 单笔仓位保证金 20 USDT, 杠杆 10x, 单笔名义值 200 USDT\n- SOUL.md: 止损公式动态计算, 保底 ≤-3%\n- SOUL.md: 三档移动止盈第1档 +2%, 第2档 +3%, 第3档 +4%\n- DOT 开仓失败后有 300 秒冷却期\n- AGENTS.md: `--push` 成功后保持沉默, 卡片本身就是答案\n\n## Pending user asks\n- (none) - last exchange was explaining SL calculation; no pending question\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- **Clash proxy**: `127.0.0.1:7890`, node `xg1.kunlun01.com:18000` → IP `103.182.96.231`, backup node `HK-Home-03`\n- **Feishu**: app_id `cli_a92eff25e5789cbd`, chat_id `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`, token cache `feishu_token.json`\n- **Binance Testnet**: `testnet.binancefuture.com:443`, API key prefix `4XOtZh5r...10XU`\n- **Logs**: `/root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log`, `/root/.openclaw/logs/clash/clash.log`\n- **Scripts**: `crypto_signal_monitor.py`, `crypto_monitor_watchdog.py`, `query_positions.py`, `openclaw_logging.py`\n- **DOT trade**: Opened SHORT 2026-05-27 00:13 @$1.262, 158.5 DOT, SL algo ID `1000000086520050` @$1.27, TP `1000000086520057` @$1.21, order ID `216329031`, clientOrderId `oc_1779812024_5ef97794ac`. Closed ~03:32 @~$1.266 with PnL -0.634 USDT\n- **Current positions**: SOL SHORT @$84.08 → $83.76 +0.76, LINK SHORT @$9.421 → $9.382 +0.83. Total floating +1.60 USDT\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Goal\n用户发现当前 SOL 和 LINK 仓位的止损约 1%，但昨天已将止损规则改为 2%，要求排查为何实际止损与设定不符，希望确保止损设在 2% 以防止被下探/扫损。\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- 止损应为入场价的 2%（做多 SL = entry × 0.98，做空 SL = entry × 1.02）\n- 止盈固定 4% 全平\n- 使用 Algo Order API 提交止损单（非普通止损单）\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] 定位了 `calc_tp_sl()` 函数（`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py:562`），确认 `STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02`（2%）\n- [x] 确认新开仓逻辑调用 `calc_tp_sl()`（line 2373-2374）\n- [x] 确认 `place_order()` → `place_algo_conditional_order()` 直接透传 sl_price，无二次计算\n- [x] 确认持仓同步逻辑也使用 `calc_tp_sl()` 重新算 SL（line 2051）\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] 排查为何 SOL 和 LINK 实际止损是 ~1% 而非 2%\n  - SOL: entry $84.13, SL $84.97 → 约 1.0%（预期 2% = $85.81）\n  - LINK: entry $9.421, SL $9.52 → 约 1.05%（预期 2% = $9.609）\n\n### Blocked\n- 尚无阻塞项；代码路径看似正确（2% SL），需进一步查看是否有其他 SL 计算入口或旧版本代码残留\n\n## Key Decisions\n- 无\n\n## Next Steps\n1. 检查 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 中是否还有旧的动态 ATR 止损公式仍在生效（SOUL.md 中提到 `止损 = max(支撑位×0.995, 价格×(1-ATR×分层倍数), 24h低点×0.98)`）\n2. 搜索是否有其他函数覆盖或重新计算 sl_price\n3. 确认当前 Binance 上的 Algo 止损单是否与本地记录的 SL 一致\n4. 如需修正，取消旧 Algo 止损单并重新提交 2% 止损单\n\n## Critical Context\n- 相关文件：\n  - `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py` - 主信号监控脚本\n  - `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py` - 币安自动交易模块（含 `place_algo_conditional_order()`）\n- `calc_tp_sl()` 函数（line 562-590）已设为 2% SL / 4% TP\n- 现有持仓 SOL（$84.13）和 LINK（$9.421）的 Algo 止损单价格不匹配 2% 规则\n\n## Pending user asks\n- 用户询问：\"昨天不是改成sl可以亏到2%吗，防止下滑探测被扫掉?\" — 需要确认代码已生效且仓位已更新\n\n## Exact identifiers\n- Conversation label: `oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49`\n- Sender ID: `ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166`\n- Message ID: `om_x100b6e56f5ab70a0b27bc50d64a45f5`\n- Reply-to message ID: `om_x100b6e56c2299ca0b4a1b03ed32a84c`\n\n## Recent turns preserved verbatim\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e56e30a28a0b2ecf35f8d7bcce\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e56c2299ca0b4a1b03ed32a84c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 07:21 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall x2]\n- Tool result (exec): 2026-05-26 09:07:57 [INFO] ✅ SOL 开仓成功，当前持仓：2/4\n2026-05-26 09:11:38 [INFO] ✅ LINK 开仓成功，当前持仓：3/4\n2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] ✅ SOL 开仓成功，当前持仓：1/4\n2026-05-27 00:13:52 [INFO] ✅ LINK 开仓成功，当前持仓：3/4\n- Tool result (exec): (no output)\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall x3]\n- Tool result (exec): 2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] 📌 SOLUSDT 止损 Algo 单已提交：84.97 algoId=1000000086519225\n2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] 📌 SOLUSDT 止盈 Algo 单已提交：80.76 algoId=1000000086519231\n- Tool result (exec): 2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] 📌 SOLUSDT 止损 Algo 单已提交：84.97 algoId=1000000086519225\n2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] 📌 SOLUSDT 止盈 Algo 单已提交：80.76 algoId=1000000086519231\n2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] ✅ 订单确认 orderId=1896073102 status=NEW\n2026-05-27 00:12:28 [INFO] 📝 下单结果：{'leverage': {'symbol': 'SOLUSDT', 'leverage': 10, 'maxNotionalValue': '1800000'}, 'order': {'orderId': 1896073102, 'symbol': 'SOLUSDT', 'status': 'NEW', 'clientOrderId': 'oc_1779811947_a71515cb50', 'price': '0.0000', 'avgPrice': '0.00', 'origQty': '2.38', 'executedQty': '0.00', 'cumQty': '0.00', 'cumQuote': '0.000000', 'timeInForce': 'G...\n- Tool result (exec): 2026-05-27 00:13:51 [INFO] 📌 LINKUSDT 止损 Algo 单已提交：9.52 algoId=1000000086520113\n2026-05-27 00:13:52 [INFO] 📌 LINKUSDT 止盈 Algo 单已提交：9.04 algoId=1000000086520117\n2026-05-27 00:13:52 [INFO] ✅ 订单确