bject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9...\n- Assistant: 差不多，具体算一下：\n\n- **SOL**：止盈 $3.37 / 止损 $0.84 = **4.0:1** ✅\n- **LINK**：止盈 $0.381 / 止损 $0.099 = **3.85:1**（接近 4:1）\n\n两笔都远超策略要求的最低 1.5:1 👑\n[non-text content: thinking]","firstKeptEntryId":"1c6bb6f9","tokensBefore":113900,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":true}
