{"type":"message","id":"07f90c4e","parentId":"de1060c8","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:17:40.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check what's already in memory/2026-05-27.md and see if there's anything new from this latest exchange to append. The latest exchange was just the user saying they'll create a new repo after class, and my acknowledgement. Not much new to add.\n\nBut let me re-read the memory file to make sure I have everything, and see if there's anything I missed from the conversation summary at the beginning that needs to be captured.\n\nActually, the conversation after the last flush was:\n1. User asked me to analyze and list specific push files for git\n2. I did a detailed analysis of what can/cannot be uploaded\n3. User said they'll create a new repo after class\n4. I acknowledged\n\nThe git analysis included:\n- Classification of files (🔴 sensitive, 🟡 contain keys but OK for private, 🟢 pure code)\n- The discussion about private repo allowing wider upload scope\n- User's concern about rollback without git\n\nLet me append these new findings.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_aI1nlVThdfZ1KaAnKuiH0000","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-27.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":50743,"output":479,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51222,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779848249324}}
{"type":"message","id":"406c90c6","parentId":"07f90c4e","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:17:40.245Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_aI1nlVThdfZ1KaAnKuiH0000","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-05-27 日志\n\n## 推送中断诊断\n- **时间**: 07:00-07:04\n- **现象**: 飞书无轮询推送，所有 API 报 SSL EOF\n- **根因**: Clash 代理节点 `xg1.kunlun01.com` (IP 103.182.96.231:18000) 间歇性不可达\n- **恢复**: Clash 健康检查后自动切到备用节点 `HK-Home-03`，07:04 恢复\n- **影响**: Binance/飞书/DeepSeek 全部 HTTPS 请求失败，monitor 跳过 2 次推送\n\n## DOT 止损记录\n- **开仓**: 00:13 SHORT @$1.262，158.5 张，评分 100\n- **止损触发**: ~03:32，成交价约 $1.266\n- **亏损**: -0.634 USDT\n- **原因**: SL 设置在 $1.27（动态 ATR 公式 ~1%），止盈本该在 $1.21\n- **注意**: 止损触发在另一个代理断连窗口，飞书未推送平仓通知\n\n## 止损比例修复 (1% → 2%)\n- **问题**: monitor 进程(PID 27448)自 2023 年 6 月起未重启，运行旧代码，实际开仓仍用动态 ATR 公式 (~1% SL) 而非源码中已改好的 2% 固定比例\n- **修复**: 老公执行 `kj` 重启，新进程(PID 15217)启动于 07:43\n- **生效**: SOL SL $85.76(2%), LINK SL $9.609(2%)，旧 Algo 单自动取消换新\n- **教训**: `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 是独立 Python 常驻进程，改代码后必须 `kj` 重启才生效，看门狗只管进程死活不管代码版本\n\n## 当前持仓 (07:44)\n- SOL SHORT @$84.08，止损 $85.76(2%)，止盈 $80.72(4%)\n- LINK SHORT @$9.421，止损 $9.609(2%)，止盈 $9.044(4%)\n- 浮动盈利 +1.40 USDT，已实现 -0.63 USDT，净盈亏 +0.77 USDT\n\n## 策略优化讨论\n老公提出 5 个优化方向（尚未实施）:\n1. 代理容灾 — API 健康探针，不通就暂停信号\n2. 假突破过滤 — 连续确认 / 价格源一致性校验\n3. 冷却期分级 — 失败后加倍冷却时间\n4. 时段感知 — 亚盘/欧美盘差异化开仓阈值\n5. 回测闭环 — userTrades 统计报告\n\n全部改 `crypto_signal_monitor.py`，仅回测可能需新脚本。\n\n## Git 版本控制\n- 已存在旧仓库: `https://github.com/yuki39lhl-huang/Morgan.git` (3 commits)\n- 老公认为不完整，想重建干净仓库\n- 讨论上传范围: `.openclaw/` 下 workspace/scripts/ 等代码文件可传，config.yaml/.env/credentials/ 等含 API 密钥的不能传\n- **尚未执行**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779848260231}}
