{"type":"message","id":"29729fcc","parentId":"ee097f4e","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:48:26.533Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The regime detection uses EMA slope and ATR which the old process had, but the log doesn't show explicit regime outputs. Let me check the 24h price changes and look at recent price movement patterns. Let me also check the monitor log for signal scoring and trend information.\n\nActually, let me look at the recent few days' PnL to get a sense:\n- May 25: +55.46U (very profitable - trending market)\n- May 26: -1.97U (small loss - possible consolidation start)\n- May 27: -0.63U (small loss - ongoing consolidation)\n\nThis suggests the market was trending strongly on May 25 (big profits) but has been ranging/choppy since May 26.\n\nLet me check more data - the 24h price changes and recent signals.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_rrSGcGvCx5fjJftzgYyt1151","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nfrom binance_auto_trade import get_klines\nimport json\n\nsymbols = ['BTCUSDT', 'ETHUSDT', 'SOLUSDT', 'DOTUSDT', 'LINKUSDT']\nfor sym in symbols:\n    klines = get_klines(sym, '1h', 48)  # 48 hours\n    if klines:\n        closes = [float(k[4]) for k in klines]\n        high_48h = max(closes)\n        low_48h = min(closes)\n        pct_range = (high_48h - low_48h) / low_48h * 100\n        pct_24h = (closes[-1] - closes[-24]) / closes[-24] * 100\n        print(f'{sym}: 48h波动 {pct_range:.2f}% | 24h涨跌 {pct_24h:+.2f}% | 范围 {low_48h:.2f}-{high_48h:.2f}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v warnings.warn","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":411,"output":661,"cacheRead":54912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55984,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779853697066}}
