{"type":"message","id":"df89da06","parentId":"6cf9daf6","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:53:11.684Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"100% packet loss to 124.11.210.175 - the IP is completely unreachable from our server. This is a network-level block. CoinDesk is likely blocked by the Great Firewall of China, or the server's network doesn't have access to that IP.\n\nThe proxy (Clash) should handle this, but the proxy also times out trying to reach CoinDesk. This suggests the proxy node (HK-Home-03) might have its own restrictions or the GFW is blocking CoinDesk even through proxies.\n\nSummary for the user:\n- CoinDesk.com resolves to IP 124.11.210.175\n- That IP is 100% packet loss from our server (GFW block)\n- Even through Clash proxy, the request times out\n- The proxy works for Binance and some other sites, but CoinDesk specifically is unreachable\n\nPossible solutions:\n1. Add a CoinDesk-specific routing rule in Clash (dedicated proxy)\n2. Use an alternative news source (CryptoPanic, CoinGecko news, etc.)\n3. Use a different proxy node that can reach CoinDesk","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"CoinDesk 的 IP `124.11.210.175` 从服务器直接 ping 不通（100% 丢包），GFW 墙了。即使走 Clash 代理节点 `HK-Home-03` 也超时——说明代理节点到 CoinDesk 的路由也有问题。\n\n简单说：CoinDesk 在国内环境+当前代理节点都访问不了。\n\n修的话两个方向：\n1. **换新闻源** — 改用 CoinGecko News API、CryptoPanic RSS，这些在国内/代理环境下通常能通\n2. **Clash 加规则** — 给 CoinDesk 单独指定一个能翻的优质节点\n\n要搞吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":203,"output":624,"cacheRead":62464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63291,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779853981794}}
