{"type":"message","id":"0bc63c0d","parentId":"4e104eb8","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:54:47.317Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"api.coingecko.com resolves to 128.242.240.212 (or 162.125.6.1). Let me also check if the proxy can reach that IP. The issue might be that the proxy node (HK-Home-03) can't reach CoinGecko either.\n\nActually, since both direct and proxy fail, and CoinGecko is a major API, it's likely the GFW blocking. Let me check if the news endpoint works.\n\nActually, at this point I should just tell the user: CoinGecko API is also blocked from our server (both direct and through proxy). Both CoinDesk and CoinGecko are unreachable. \n\nPotential alternatives:\n1. CryptoPanic API (different IP, might work)\n2. Use a different Clash proxy node that can access these APIs\n3. Use a Chinese crypto news source (like Jinse/金色财经)\n\nLet me try one more thing - the existing `query_price.py` script used CoinGecko as backup. Let me check if it can access CoinGecko at all.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"CoinGecko 也走不通，直连和代理都超时。你的服务器环境限制比较严，常见海外加密 API 基本被封。\n\n可行的替代方案：\n\n| 方案 | 可行性 |\n|:---|:---|\n| **CryptoPanic** (`cryptopanic.com`) | 免费 API，端口 443，有可能通 |\n| **金色财经 RSS** | 国内源，不翻墙直接通 |\n| **换 Clash 节点** | 当前 `HK-Home-03` 访问范围有限，换个美国/日本节点可能全通 |\n\n要不要我先试下 CryptoPanic 能不能通？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":115,"output":576,"cacheRead":64512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65203,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779854078515}}
