{"type":"message","id":"ce416f2d","parentId":"2881a40d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:58:17.427Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about CoinGecko specifically - can it work through the proxy? I already tested this and it failed. Let me double-check by trying a few different approaches to access CoinGecko through the proxy.\n\nActually, I already tested:\n1. Direct connection to api.coingecko.com → timeout (http_code=000)\n2. Through proxy to api.coingecko.com → timeout (http_code=000)\n3. Through proxy to pro-api.coingecko.com → timeout (http_code=000)\n\nAll failed. But let me try one more thing - maybe the proxy needs DNS resolution, or there's a different endpoint that works.\n\nActually, let me just be honest: I already tested CoinGecko with proxy and it failed. The issue might be that the HK-Home-03 proxy node itself can't reach CoinGecko, or the GFW is blocking it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"CoinGecko 已经试过三种方式，全挂了：\n\n| 方式 | 结果 |\n|:---|:---|\n| 直连 `api.coingecko.com` | 超时 |\n| 走代理 `api.coingecko.com` | 超时 |\n| 走代理 `pro-api.coingecko.com` | 超时 |\n\n代理只对 `testnet.binancefuture.com`（币安测试网）和 `httpbin.org` 等少数域名有效，CoinGecko 和 CoinDesk 都穿透不了。问题出在代理节点 `HK-Home-03` 的出口限制——它自己可能也访问不了这些加密数据平台，或者被 GFW 的 DPI 在更上层拦截了。\n\n换个美国或日本出口的代理节点大概率能解决，要看看 Clash 订阅里有什么可选节点吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":348,"output":549,"cacheRead":66432,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67329,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779854288479}}
