{"type":"message","id":"f3c75291","parentId":"a6c77ce2","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:01:38.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The subscription returns a LOT of new nodes that aren't in the current clash-config.yaml! The current config only has about 6 nodes, but the subscription has nodes in:\n\n- 🇺🇸 USA (Los Angeles) - 4 nodes\n- 🇭🇰 Hong Kong - 4 nodes\n- 🇰🇷 Korea - 4 nodes\n- 🇹🇼 Taiwan - 4 nodes\n- 🇯🇵 Japan (Tokyo, Osaka) - 4 nodes\n- 🇸🇬 Singapore - 2 nodes\n- 🇹🇭 Thailand - 2 nodes\n- 🇩🇪 Germany - 2 nodes\n- 🇫🇷 France - 2 nodes\n- 🇳🇱 Netherlands - 2 nodes\n\nThis is the key issue! The clash-config.yaml was hand-written with just a few nodes, but the subscription has many more including US, Germany, France, Netherlands nodes that would likely access CoinGecko just fine.\n\nThe problem is that Clash/Mihomo isn't set up to use the subscription URL to auto-update nodes. The config is static.\n\nThe current config has `HK-Home-03` as the primary and others as fallback, but the full subscription has MANY more nodes that aren't in the config at all.\n\nI should suggest:\n1. Update clash-config.yaml to include nodes from the subscription\n2. Specifically add US/Germany/Netherlands nodes which would have full access to CoinGecko/CoinDesk\n\nOr better yet, configure Clash to use `proxy-providers` to auto-pull from the subscription URL.\n\nActually, the most practical fix is to update the clash config to include all the subscription nodes. But this is a lot of work to do manually.\n\nLet me just tell the user: yes, this is the subscription, and it has WAY more nodes than what's in the current config. Adding nodes like 🇺🇸 USA or 🇩🇪 Germany would likely solve the CoinGecko issue.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"订阅能拉取，而且节点比当前配置多得多！\n\n**当前 config 里只有 6 个节点**，但订阅里有 **30+ 个节点**：\n\n| 地区 | 数量 | 当前有？ |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 🇺🇸 美国洛杉矶 | 4 | ❌ |\n| 🇭🇰 香港 | 4 | ✅ 有 2 个 |\n| 🇯🇵 日本东京/大阪 | 4 | ✅ 有 2 个 |\n| 🇰🇷 韩国 | 4 | ✅ 有 1 个 |\n| 🇸🇬 新加坡 | 2 | ✅ 有 1 个 |\n| 🇹🇼 台湾 | 4 | ❌ |\n| 🇩🇪 德国 | 2 | ❌ |\n| 🇫🇷 法国 | 2 | ❌ |\n| 🇳🇱 荷兰 | 2 | ❌ |\n| 🇹🇭 泰国 | 2 | ❌ |\n\n问题找到了——Clash 配置是手写的静态节点，没有用 `proxy-providers` 自动从订阅拉。你客户端用的日本节点没问题，因为 `rb.kunlun01.com` 没被墙。我把配置改成从订阅自动拉节点，这样 CoinGecko 走美国/德国出口就通了。\n\n要改吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2118,"output":1124,"cacheRead":77824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81066,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779854484332}}
