{"type":"message","id":"e3e2780d","parentId":"6ec12738","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:03:28.907Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full config. The rules section already routes coindesk.com to PROXY, but PROXY uses fallback mode and CoinDesk isn't reachable through any of the current nodes.\n\nI need to:\n1. Create a new proxy group specifically for crypto data APIs, using JP nodes as primary\n2. Add routing rules for CoinDesk and CoinGecko to use this new group\n\nOr simpler: just change the rules for CoinDesk/CoinGecko to directly use JP-Tokyo-01 instead of PROXY.\n\nThe simplest approach: create a dedicated proxy group `CRYPTO-NEWS` that prioritizes Japan nodes, and route CoinDesk + CoinGecko through it.\n\nLet me add:\n1. A new proxy-group `CRYPTO-NEWS` with JP nodes first, then HK, then SG\n2. Rules for coingecko.com and coindesk.com\n\nActually, the cleanest approach: I can use a `select` group that the user can switch, or a `fallback` group. Since the user said JP works, let me use a fallback group with JP nodes first.\n\nLet me modify the config:\n1. Add a new proxy-group after the existing PROXY group:\n```yaml\n  - name: CRYPTO-NEWS\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - HK-Home-03\n      - SG-02\n    url: http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204\n    interval: 60\n    timeout: 5\n```\n\n2. Change the rules:\n- Remove `DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coindesk.com,PROXY`\n- Add `DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coindesk.com,CRYPTO-NEWS`\n- Add `DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coingecko.com,CRYPTO-NEWS`\n\nAfter modifying, need to restart Clash (mihomo) for changes to take effect.\n\nBut wait - restarting Clash will briefly interrupt Binance connections. Since monitor is running and positions have Algo orders on Binance, a brief Clash restart should be fine. But I should warn the user.\n\nLet me also keep the deepseek, feishu rules as-is since they go DIRECT.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_EP372XILqBLmW8KpLDZL7077","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/clash-config.yaml","old_string":"proxy-groups:\n  - name: PROXY\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - HK-Home-03\n      - HK-Home-04\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - KR-Home-01\n      - SG-02\n    url: http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204\n    interval: 30\n    timeout: 5\n\nrules:\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,api.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,testnet.binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,stream.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coindesk.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.deepseek.com,DIRECT","new_string":"proxy-groups:\n  - name: PROXY\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - HK-Home-03\n      - HK-Home-04\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - KR-Home-01\n      - SG-02\n    url: http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204\n    interval: 30\n    timeout: 5\n\n  - name: CRYPTO-NEWS\n    type: fallback\n    proxies:\n      - JP-Tokyo-01\n      - JP-Tokyo-02\n      - SG-02\n      - HK-Home-03\n    url: http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204\n    interval: 60\n    timeout: 5\n\nrules:\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,api.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,testnet.binancefuture.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN,stream.binance.com,PROXY\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coindesk.com,CRYPTO-NEWS\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coingecko.com,CRYPTO-NEWS\n  - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,api.deepseek.com,DIRECT"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1542,"output":1590,"cacheRead":81280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84412,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779854591807}}
