{"type":"message","id":"312a3ee5","parentId":"f9dffb1d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:05:03.185Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the proxy works for httpbin.org. But CoinGecko doesn't even generate a log entry. That suggests the CoinGecko request might be matching a rule before it can go through CRYPTO-NEWS. Let me check the rules order more carefully.\n\nWait, actually the CoinGecko request might be timing out at the DNS level or connection level before it gets to the proxy. Let me check if the rule is even matching.\n\nActually, let me check the clash log in real time by tailing it and trying a request.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_BfNt0k1y4lh35NM0w69r8957","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --proxy http://127.0.0.1:7890 --max-time 5 'https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/ping' 2>&1 & sleep 1 && tail -5 /root/.openclaw/logs/clash/clash.log | grep -i 'coingecko\\|coindesk\\|TCP\\|match'","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":73,"output":359,"cacheRead":87040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87472,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779854697420}}
