{"type":"message","id":"a25835fc","parentId":"e53fd663","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:48:48.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is checking in. Let me update on what happened - the CoinDesk RSS and CoinGecko ping work through the Japan node, but CoinGecko news API failed with an SSL error. Let me re-test and give a current status. Also should check positions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"CoinDesk 和币安新闻通了（19 条），CoinGecko 新闻 API SSL 报错，可能 CRYPTO-NEWS 组健康检查切到了韩国节点不稳定。帮你看下当前情况："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_uC7KzZ9caadMstc2Rflz8716","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s 'http://127.0.0.1:9090/proxies' | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor g in ['CRYPTO-NEWS', 'PROXY']:\n    p=d['proxies'].get(g,{})\n    history = p.get('history', [])\n    recent = ', '.join([f\\\"{h.get('now')}({h.get('delay')}ms)\\\" for h in history[-3:]]) if history else 'N/A'\n    print(f'{g}: now={p.get(\\\"now\\\",\\\"?\\\")} | history=[{recent}]')\n\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_k4IDNetzUKX9m6azWoe52204","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -5 /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log | grep -E 'INFO|ERROR|持仓|盈亏'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":567,"output":404,"cacheRead":96640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97611,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779857321811}}
