{"type":"message","id":"0d191db6","parentId":"f551ba64","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:49:09.161Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so:\n1. CoinGecko ping still works - `To the Moon!` ✅\n2. CoinGecko news API returns error 10005 - \"This request is limited to PRO API subscribers\"\n\nThe free CoinGecko API key `CG-DZoCE8UMF3FWpeYhBMvqGq4g` doesn't have access to the news endpoint. It's a PRO-only feature. So the news API requires a paid subscription.\n\nThat's fine - CoinDesk RSS is working, and that's the primary news source. The CoinGecko API key can be used for price data as backup but not news.\n\nLet me update the user:\n1. CoinDesk RSS ✅ (primary news source)\n2. CoinGecko ping ✅ (price backup works)\n3. CoinGecko news ❌ (PRO-only, needs paid subscription)\n4. Position status: 4/4, monitor healthy\n\nThe news fetcher update was still useful because:\n- Fixed CoinDesk URL from http to https (works now)\n- CoinGecko news added but will be skipped due to API limit\n- The important thing is CoinDesk + Binance news work\n\nLet me present this clearly and remove the broken CoinGecko news code or mark it as PRO-only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"总结一下：\n\n**✅ 已搞定**\n- CoinDesk RSS — 10 条新闻正常抓取\n- 币安公告 — 10 条正常\n- CoinGecko 价格 API — 备用价格源通了\n\n**❌ CoinGecko 新闻** — API 返回 `error 10005: PRO API subscribers only`。你的免费 key 没开新闻权限，这个是付费功能，暂时跳过。\n\n当前只改了 `crypto_news_fetcher.py` 文件，CoinDesk 从 http 切 https + 加了 CoinGecko 新闻函数（没权限会自动跳过）。\n\n持仓正常：4/4 满仓，浮动 +$2 左右，monitor 稳定运行 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":180,"output":688,"cacheRead":98048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98916,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779857339238}}
