{"type":"message","id":"32f92bb4","parentId":"bf55f357","timestamp":"2026-05-27T05:06:40.956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All data is in, let me present it clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**📊 实时行情**\n\n| 币种 | 现价 | \n|:---|:---|\n| BTC | $75,591 |\n| ETH | $2,072 |\n| SOL | $83.64 |\n| BNB | $654.93 |\n| DOT | $1.252 |\n| LINK | $9.403 |\n| XRP | $1.331 |\n\n**📈 持仓（4/4）**\n\n| 方向 | 入场 | 现价 | 浮盈 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| SOL 空 | $84.08 | $83.64 | 🟢 +$1.05 |\n| DOT 空 | $1.253 | $1.253 | ⚪ $0.00 |\n| ETH 空 | $2,072 | $2,072 | 🔴 -$0.02 |\n| LINK 空 | $9.421 | $9.403 | 🟢 +$0.38 |\n\n浮动 +$1.41 | 净盈亏 **+$0.78**\n\n大盘还在阴跌中，BTC 从早上到现在又掉了 $100，整体偏弱 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":495,"output":276,"cacheRead":99072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99843,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779858395348}}
