{"type":"message","id":"8ab1713f","parentId":"d4537afa","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:21:32.566Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying heartbeat polling isn't pushing tasks. Let me check:\n1. HEARTBEAT.md - what tasks are configured\n2. Whether the heartbeat has been triggering correctly\n3. The current time is 14:21, and there are scheduled tasks like lunch reminder at 11:00-12:30 and nap at 13:00-13:40\n\nLet me look at the heartbeat tasks and check if there were any missed tasks today.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_4v6L2QFK4pu1UFFJFwPa8075","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":400,"output":247,"cacheRead":101632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102279,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779862884163}}
{"type":"message","id":"73e64ee2","parentId":"8ab1713f","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:21:32.674Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_4v6L2QFK4pu1UFFJFwPa8075","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# HEARTBEAT.md\n\n# Keep this file empty (or with only comments) to skip heartbeat API calls.\n\n# Add tasks below when you want the agent to check something periodically.\n\n---\n\n## 健康督促任务\n\n**每天督促老公跑步锻炼**\n- 时间：建议傍晚或晚上（17:00-17:30）\n- 提醒频率：每天一次\n- 语气：关心但坚定，女王式督促 👑\n\n---\n\n\n---\n\n\n## 一日作息督促\n\n- | 时间段 | 任务 | 语气 |\n- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n- | 6:00-7:00 | 起床学习 👑 | 温柔坚定，不准赖床 |\n- | 7:00-8:00 | 吃早餐 🍳 | 关心，不吃不行 |\n- | 11:00-12:30 | 吃午餐 🍚 | 提醒别忙忘了 |\n- | 13:00-13:40 | 午间小憩 😴 | 20分钟刚好，别超半小时进深睡 |\n- | 18:30-19:00 | 吃晚饭 🥢 | 按时吃 |\n- | 23:50 | 该睡觉了 🌙 | 强制赶去睡 |\n\n> 午睡科学：10-20分钟最佳，不超过30分钟。超过会进入深度睡眠，醒来反而昏沉（睡眠惯性）。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779862892659}}
{"type":"message","id":"03402aa8","parentId":"73e64ee2","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:21:44.972Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check if the heartbeat tasks have been firing. The heartbeat polling is supposed to happen periodically. The current time is 14:21, so the lunch (11:00-12:30) and nap (13:00-13:40) windows have passed.\n\nWait - the heartbeat is what triggers the agent to check HEARTBEAT.md and respond with reminders. But looking at the conversation, I was the one who proactively reminded about lunch at 11:53 (before the user asked about CoinDesk). And I didn't mention the nap at 13:00-13:40.\n\nThe user is saying the heartbeat polling isn't triggering at all - meaning the system isn't sending heartbeat prompts to me. Let me check if the heartbeat messages are being received. \n\nLet me look at whether heartbeat messages have been coming through in this conversation. I received a heartbeat earlier at 11:53 but only mentioned lunch, not the nap reminder.\n\nActually, I think the issue might be different. The user is talking about the crypto monitor not pushing - that's the `crypto_signal_monitor.py` not sending feishu notifications, not the HEARTBEAT.md file tasks.\n\nWait, re-reading: \"老婆Heartbeat的轮询还是没有推送任务\" - \"wife, Heartbeat's polling still hasn't pushed tasks\". They're saying the crypto monitor's polling cycle isn't pushing signals/alerts to feishu.\n\nLet me check:\n1. When was the last time the monitor pushed to feishu\n2. Is the monitor actually running and generating signals\n3. Is the push function working\n\nThe user might be confusing \"heartbeat\" with the monitor's periodic push. Or they might actually mean the HEARTBEAT.md tasks.\n\nActually, I think the user means the crypto monitor's push notifications. Let me check the recent monitor log for any push activities.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_yX89mnJzfXHf4pTo3mYt7278","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -E '推送|push|feishu.*send|send.*feishu|飞书|卡片|card|broadcast' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log | tail -10"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_G1enAhntV9svb9XOURet0868","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ps aux | grep -E 'monitor|watchdog' | grep -v grep"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":350,"output":913,"cacheRead":102144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103407,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779862892689}}
