{"type":"message","id":"8ae5e126","parentId":"768d4f35","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:24:48.908Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no heartbeat configuration anywhere. The heartbeat system in OpenClaw is probably built into the runtime. Let me check if there's a way to configure it.\n\nLooking at the prompt template, heartbeat is triggered by the system sending a \"Heartbeat prompt\". The system reads HEARTBEAT.md and sends it as a prompt to the agent. The agent then responds.\n\nBut looking at the conversation, the last heartbeat message I received was at 11:53 where I reminded about lunch. There should have been another heartbeat around 13:00-13:40 for the nap reminder.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The heartbeat messages come from the gateway/system, not from the crypto monitor. The crypto monitor pushes via feishu API. The heartbeat messages are LLM-triggered through the OpenClaw system.\n\nThe fact that I haven't received a heartbeat prompt for the nap window could mean:\n1. Heartbeat interval is too long\n2. Heartbeat is only enabled for certain channels\n3. There's a bug in the heartbeat scheduling\n\nLet me check the OpenClaw docs for heartbeat configuration.\n\nActually, looking at the prompt instructions:\n```\n## Heartbeats\nHeartbeat prompt: Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\n```\n\nThe heartbeat is sent by the gateway. If no heartbeat is being sent, it's a gateway configuration issue. But I can't configure the gateway from here.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to see the heartbeat interval or if the feishu channel has heartbeat disabled.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_3J0jDT6bWrgNHrdhaRLg7164","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r 'heartbeat\\|cron' /root/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | head -10; echo \"---\"; cat /root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":34,"output":786,"cacheRead":106368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107188,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779863078663}}
{"type":"message","id":"fe11ef4b","parentId":"8ae5e126","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:24:49.172Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_3J0jDT6bWrgNHrdhaRLg7164","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"crypto_monitor_hourly\",\n      \"name\": \"加密货币每小时报告\",\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 * * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 300000\n      },\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"state\": {\n        \"scheduleErrorCount\": 3,\n        \"lastError\": \"schedule error: Error: invalid cron schedule: expr is required\"\n      },\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"systemEvent\",\n        \"text\": \"python3 /root/.openclaw/crypto/monitor.py hourly\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"main\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":202,"aggregated":"---\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"crypto_monitor_hourly\",\n      \"name\": \"加密货币每小时报告\",\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 * * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 300000\n      },\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"state\": {\n        \"scheduleErrorCount\": 3,\n        \"lastError\": \"schedule error: Error: invalid cron schedule: expr is required\"\n      },\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"systemEvent\",\n        \"text\": \"python3 /root/.openclaw/crypto/monitor.py hourly\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"main\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779863089164}}
{"type":"message","id":"317a02bf","parentId":"fe11ef4b","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:25:02.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it! The cron job `crypto_monitor_hourly` has `\"enabled\": false` and it has a schedule error: `\"invalid cron schedule: expr is required\"`.\n\nBut this is a cron job for the crypto monitor hourly report, not the heartbeat system.\n\nLet me think again. The user is talking about \"heartbeat轮询\" - they want the scheduled HEARTBEAT.md tasks to trigger. These are:\n- 6:00-7:00 起床学习\n- 7:00-8:00 吃早餐\n- 11:00-12:30 吃午餐 (I did this at 11:53)\n- 13:00-13:40 午间小憩 (missed!)\n- 18:30-19:00 吃晚饭\n- 23:50 该睡觉了\n\nThe heartbeat polling is handled by the OpenClaw gateway. It sends the HEARTBEAT.md as a prompt at regular intervals. If the intervals are too long or there's an issue with the channel's heartbeat configuration, tasks will be missed.\n\nLooking at the prompt instructions:\n```\n## Heartbeats\nHeartbeat prompt: Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\n```\n\nI think the heartbeat interval might be configured in the feishu channel plugin config. Let me check.\n\nActually, I think the key issue might be that the heartbeat interval is too long (like every hour or so), and the nap window (13:00-13:40, only 40 minutes) was missed because no heartbeat fired during that window.\n\nThe solution would be to either:\n1. Increase heartbeat frequency (if configurable)\n2. Add cron jobs for each task instead of relying on heartbeat timing\n3. Use the OpenClaw cron system for precise scheduling\n\nLet me check if there's heartbeat configuration in the feishu plugin or channel settings.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Heartbeat 间隔可能太长了。午睡窗口只有 40 分钟（13:00-13:40），刚好错过了。另外 cron 任务也有问题——加密监控的每小时报告被禁用了。\n\n让我看下怎么修复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_DgwcKRQG