{"type":"message","id":"c5183c0a","parentId":"e19a4869","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:38:16.225Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These commands keep timing out. Maybe the openclaw CLI needs the gateway running and it's having issues connecting.\n\nActually, the issue might be that `openclaw gateway restart` killed the connection and the subsequent CLI commands can't connect to the gateway anymore because they're running in the sandbox which can't reach the gateway.\n\nWait, but we're still chatting through Feishu, so the gateway IS running. The CLI commands are just timing out - could be a sandbox restriction.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Instead of using OpenClaw's cron system, let me just use Linux's built-in cron (crontab) to trigger curl commands that send messages through the OpenClaw gateway API.\n\nActually wait - the real issue is that the OpenClaw gateway needs to restart to pick up the cron jobs.json. And restart kills my session. Let me think of another way...\n\nMaybe I can use the gateway's REST API to reload the cron config? Let me check what APIs are available.\n\nOr I could use Linux crontab to send API calls. But I need to find out how to send a message to the feishu group from outside OpenClaw.\n\nActually, the simplest solution: use Linux crontab + the openclaw CLI to send messages. Let me try:\n```\nopenclaw message send --channel feishu --chat <chat_id> --message \"test\"\n```\n\nBut the openclaw CLI keeps timing out from the sandbox.\n\nLet me try another approach - use curl to call the Feishu API directly. The monitor already does this with a feishu token. Let me check how the monitor sends messages.\n\nActually, let me just tell the user what's happening: the cron system needs the gateway to restart fully to load the config, but restarting kills our session. The gateway can't hot-reload. So we need to either:\n1. Use Linux crontab instead\n2. Accept the restart downtime\n3. Find a way to trigger reload without restart\n\nLet me try using Linux crontab as an alternative.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw 的 cron 需要 gateway 完整重启才能加载，但重启会断掉我们现在的会话。换方案——直接用系统 crontab 更可靠："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_twV5NMhlDQSG6BBjw0o13514","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"crontab -l 2>/dev/null","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":169,"output":960,"cacheRead":55936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779863882914}}
