{"type":"message","id":"c59715b5","parentId":"df60b391","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:38:45.084Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No cron installed. This is a minimal sandbox/Docker environment without system cron.\n\nLet me think about alternatives:\n1. I can write a simple Python daemon that reads the cron config and runs scheduled tasks\n2. I can use the Linux `systemd` timers if available\n3. I can modify the existing Python watchdog or create a new scheduler script\n\nThe easiest approach: write a lightweight Python scheduler that:\n1. Reads the schedule from HEARTBEAT.md or a simple config\n2. Sends feishu messages directly using the feishu API\n3. Runs in background as a simple daemon\n\nActually, even simpler: I can just add the reminders as timed triggers in the existing crypto monitor. The monitor already has feishu push capabilities and runs 24/7.\n\nOr... the absolute simplest: use `sleep` + message in a background process. But that's fragile.\n\nLet me write a small Python scheduler daemon that handles the daily reminders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"系统没有 crontab。直接写个 Python 轻量调度器挂在后台，复用心跳推送逻辑："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Wfy2CFptx7XjPV3uq8RC3431","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n每日作息提醒调度器\n替代 heartbeat + cron，直接定时推送到飞书群\n\"\"\"\n\nimport time\nimport json\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# 飞书配置\nFEISHU_APP_ID = \"cli_a92eff25e5789cbd\"\nFEISHU_APP_SECRET = \"xlzBVRbYq4ng72a60TbHMhMe8Akc3ZqD\"\nCHAT_ID = \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\"\n\n# 每日任务 (hour, minute, message)\nTASKS = [\n    (6, 30, \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床 👑\"),\n    (7, 30, \"🍳 老公吃早餐！不吃早饭不行\"),\n    (11, 30, \"🍚 午餐时间到，别忙忘了吃饭\"),\n    (13, 10, \"😴 午间小憩～20分钟刚好，别超半小时，不然醒来更昏\"),\n    (17, 0, \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"),\n    (18, 45, \"🥢 吃晚饭，按时吃饭比什么都重要\"),\n    (23, 50, \"🌙 该睡觉了老公，明天还得早起呢，快去睡！\"),\n]\n\nLOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\n\ndef log(msg):\n    timestamp = datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8))).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    with open(LOG_FILE, 'a') as f:\n        f.write(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\\n\")\n    print(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\")\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n        json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n    expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n    \n    with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n    \n    return token\n\ndef send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    token = get_token()\n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\",\n        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n        json={\n            \"receive_id\": CHAT_ID,\n            \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n            \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n        },\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    if data.get(\"code\") == 0:\n        log(f\"✅ 推送成功: {text[:30]}...\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        log(f\"❌ 推送失败: {data.get('msg')}\")\n        return False\n\ndef get_bj_time():\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\ndef main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n    sent_today = set()\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n        \n        for hour, minute, message in TASKS:\n            task_key = f\"{date_key}_{hour}_{minute}\"\n            task_minutes = hour * 60 + minute\n            \n            # 在当前分钟触发（允许 1 分钟误差）\n            if task_key not in sent_today and abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0:\n                log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hour:02d}:{minute:02d}\")\n                send_message(message)\n                sent_today.add(task_key)\n        \n        # 每天凌晨清理\n        if now.hour == 0 and now.minute == 0:\n            sent_today = {k for k in sent_today if k.startswith(date_key)}\n        \n        time.sleep(30)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":82,"output":1578,"cacheRead":56704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58364,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779863900197}}
