{"type":"message","id":"025b269a","parentId":"2dc0de46","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:39:34.414Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It works! The scheduler sent a test message successfully. \n\nThe scheduler is running in the background (PID 13299). It checks every 30 seconds for matching tasks. The tasks are:\n- 6:30 wake up\n- 7:30 breakfast\n- 11:30 lunch\n- 13:10 nap\n- 17:00 running\n- 18:45 dinner\n- 23:50 sleep\n\nThe next task is at 17:00 for running. Let me tell the user the good news.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**通了！** 你看到飞书消息了吗？\n\n新的调度器方案：\n- 独立 Python 进程 `reminder_scheduler.py` 后台运行\n- 每 30 秒检查一次，到点直接调飞书 API 推送\n- 不依赖 OpenClaw gateway 重载，不依赖 heartbeat 轮询\n- 按 7 个时段精确触发\n\n下一个任务是今天 **17:00 跑步提醒** 🏃👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":173,"output":321,"cacheRead":59136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59630,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779863968062}}
