{"type":"message","id":"2ac84b5b","parentId":"8a086254","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:41:14.734Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about how the previous running reminder was pushed. They're comparing the new scheduler with the old system.\n\nLooking at the conversation history - the previous running reminder was sent via the heartbeat system. Heartbeat polls the agent, the agent reads HEARTBEAT.md, and the agent responds with a reminder. Since this is a Feishu group chat, the agent's response goes directly to the group.\n\nThe difference was:\n- Before: heartbeat → agent reads HEARTBEAT.md → agent replies to feishu group (same as how I reply to any message)\n- Now: Python scheduler → direct feishu API call → message in group\n\nBoth deliver to the same place (this Feishu group). The difference is reliability and timing precision.\n\nBut actually, the user might also mean the crypto monitor's push - but that's for trading, not running. The running reminder was definitely from HEARTBEAT.md via the heartbeat system.\n\nLet me keep it simple.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"之前就是通过这个 HEARTBEAT.md → heartbeat 轮询 → 我回复的方式。和你现在跟我聊天用的是同一条通道。\n\n问题就是 heartbeat 轮询间隔不固定，40 分钟的窄窗口（比如午睡）容易错过。现在的 `reminder_scheduler.py` 是用飞书 API 直接推，不经过心跳轮询，精确到分钟。两种方式消息都是发到这个群，你看到的效果一样 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":288,"output":496,"cacheRead":59520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60304,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779864065156}}
