{"type":"message","id":"dcd4bf4a","parentId":"f95587fd","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:32.609Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e5fff3c58c4b28580e97e62c09\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 17:36 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e5fff3c58c4b28580e97e62c09]\n用户124241: 老婆下次推送跑步前先查询一下老公我在东莞的气温再告诉我跑步"}],"timestamp":1779874592582}}
{"type":"message","id":"753862cc","parentId":"dcd4bf4a","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:36.738Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants the running reminder to include the weather for Dongguan (东莞) before telling him to run. I need to:\n1. Read the weather SKILL.md\n2. Modify the reminder_scheduler.py to fetch weather for 东莞 before the running reminder","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8onEsoTvPvaZfqiy7s1c6125","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":309,"output":165,"cacheRead":64128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64602,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779874592601}}
{"type":"message","id":"589e6b5b","parentId":"753862cc","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:36.853Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_8onEsoTvPvaZfqiy7s1c6125","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: \"Get current weather and forecasts via wttr.in or Open-Meteo. Use when: user asks about weather, temperature, or forecasts for any location. NOT for: historical weather data, severe weather alerts, or detailed meteorological analysis. No API key needed.\"\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: { \"openclaw\": { \"emoji\": \"☔\", \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"curl\"] } } }\n---\n\n# Weather Skill\n\nGet current weather conditions and forecasts.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **USE this skill when:**\n\n- \"What's the weather?\"\n- \"Will it rain today/tomorrow?\"\n- \"Temperature in [city]\"\n- \"Weather forecast for the week\"\n- Travel planning weather checks\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n❌ **DON'T use this skill when:**\n\n- Historical weather data → use weather archives/APIs\n- Climate analysis or trends → use specialized data sources\n- Hyper-local microclimate data → use local sensors\n- Severe weather alerts → check official NWS sources\n- Aviation/marine weather → use specialized services (METAR, etc.)\n\n## Location\n\nAlways include a city, region, or airport code in weather queries.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Current Weather\n\n```bash\n# One-line summary\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n\n# Detailed current conditions\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?0\"\n\n# Specific city\ncurl \"wttr.in/New+York?format=3\"\n```\n\n### Forecasts\n\n```bash\n# 3-day forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London\"\n\n# Week forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n\n# Specific day (0=today, 1=tomorrow, 2=day after)\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?1\"\n```\n\n### Format Options\n\n```bash\n# One-liner\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%w\"\n\n# JSON output\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=j1\"\n\n# PNG image\ncurl \"wttr.in/London.png\"\n```\n\n### Format Codes\n\n- `%c` — Weather condition emoji\n- `%t` — Temperature\n- `%f` — \"Feels like\"\n- `%w` — Wind\n- `%h` — Humidity\n- `%p` — Precipitation\n- `%l` — Location\n\n## Quick Responses\n\n**\"What's the weather?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+(feels+like+%f),+%w+wind,+%h+humidity\"\n```\n\n**\"Will it rain?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%p\"\n```\n\n**\"Weekend forecast\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- No API key needed (uses wttr.in)\n- Rate limited; don't spam requests\n- Works for most global cities\n- Supports airport codes: `curl wttr.in/ORD`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779874596844}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1735d90","parentId":"589e6b5b","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:42.438Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to modify the reminder_scheduler.py to:\n1. Fetch weather for 东莞 (Dongguan) before the running reminder\n2. Include temperature info in the running message\n\nLet me use wttr.in for the weather query. The format: `curl \"wttr.in/Dongguan?format=%l:+%c+%t+%f+%w+%h\"` \n\nI'll modify the Python scheduler to:\n1. Add a `get_weather()` function that calls wttr.in\n2. Modify the 17:00 task to include weather info\n\nLet me read the current scheduler code and modify it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8izIUEsDy3ojE3il6QzG2608","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":736,"output":331,"cacheRead":64512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65579,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779874596859}}
{"type":"message","id":"2895cd11","parentId":"e1735d90","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:42.599Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_8izIUEsDy3ojE3il6QzG2608","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n每日作息提醒调度器\n替代 heartbeat + cron，直接定时推送到飞书群\n\"\"\"\n\nimport time\nimport json\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# 飞书配置\nFEISHU_APP_ID = \"cli_a92eff25e5789cbd\"\nFEISHU_APP_SECRET = \"xlzBVRbYq4ng72a60TbHMhMe8Akc3ZqD\"\nCHAT_ID = \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\"  # 老公的 open_id，私聊\n\n# 每日任务 (hour, minute, message)\nTASKS = [\n    (6, 30, \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床 👑\"),\n    (7, 30, \"🍳 老公吃早餐！不吃早饭不行\"),\n    (11, 30, \"🍚 午餐时间到，别忙忘了吃饭\"),\n    (13, 10, \"😴 午间小憩～20分钟刚好，别超半小时，不然醒来更昏\"),\n    (17, 0, \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"),\n    (18, 45, \"🥢 吃晚饭，按时吃饭比什么都重要\"),\n    (23, 50, \"🌙 该睡觉了老公，明天还得早起呢，快去睡！\"),\n]\n\nLOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\n\ndef log(msg):\n    timestamp = datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8))).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    with open(LOG_FILE, 'a') as f:\n        f.write(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\\n\")\n    print(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\")\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n        json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n    expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n    \n    with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n    \n    return token\n\ndef send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    token = get_token()\n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n        json={\n            \"receive_id\": CHAT_ID,\n            \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n            \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n        },\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    if data.get(\"code\") == 0:\n        log(f\"✅ 推送成功: {text[:30]}...\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        log(f\"❌ 推送失败: {data.get('msg')}\")\n        return False\n\ndef get_bj_time():\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\ndef main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n    sent_today = set()\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n        \n        for hour, minute, message in TASKS:\n            task_key = f\"{date_key}_{hour}_{minute}\"\n            task_minutes = hour * 60 + minute\n            \n            # 在当前分钟触发（允许 1 分钟误差）\n            if task_key not in sent_today and abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0:\n                log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hour:02d}:{minute:02d}\")\n                send_message(message)\n                sent_today.add(task_key)\n        \n        # 每天凌晨清理\n        if now.hour == 0 and now.minute == 0:\n            sent_today = {k for k in sent_today if k.startswith(date_key)}\n        \n        time.sleep(30)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779874602586}}
{"type":"message","id":"b19a224d","parentId":"2895cd11","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:36:51.219Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to modify two things:\n1. Add a `get_weather()` function that calls wttr.in for 东莞\n2. Modify the 17:00 running task to be dynamic - it should call get_weather() and include the temperature\n\nThe simplest approach: make the tasks support callables (functions) for dynamic messages, or just special-case the running task.\n\nLet me rewrite the TASKS list to use callables, where the running task fetches weather at trigger time.\n\nActually, simpler: I'll use a special string marker like `{weather}` in the message, and when the 17:00 task triggers, replace it with the actual weather.\n\nOr even simpler: just check if it's the running task and add weather info.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_wCF25sa2duVb6zdAih3a5456","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"LOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\nWEATHER_CITY = \"Dongguan\"","old_string":"LOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")","path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1135,"output":479,"cacheRead":65408,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67022,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779874602610}}
