{"type":"message","id":"fa0acf5b","parentId":"6d222629","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:42:20.022Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether the weather data is hardcoded (写死) or real-time (实时). I just ran the curl command and got 37°C, but the user wants to know if tomorrow at 17:00 it will dynamically fetch the temperature or if it's a fixed string.\n\nThe answer is: it's dynamic - the `get_weather()` function calls wttr.in API in real-time at the moment the reminder triggers. Every day at 17:00 it will fetch the current Dongguan weather.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"实时的。每天 17:00 触发跑步提醒时，先调 wttr.in API 查东莞当前天气，拿到数据才拼消息。高温天体感 40+ 度它也会如实告诉你——到时候你可以名正言顺偷懒 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":412,"output":275,"cacheRead":68096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68783,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779874932986}}
