{"type":"message","id":"209dbf6d","parentId":"2187d718","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:46:13.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking which script is doing the push and whether HEARTBEAT.md is now useless. Let me clarify:\n\n1. The push is now done by `reminder_scheduler.py` (the new Python scheduler)\n2. HEARTBEAT.md was the old system - it relied on the OpenClaw gateway sending heartbeat prompts to the LLM, and the LLM responding with reminders. This was unreliable because the timing depended on when the heartbeat happened to fire.\n\nSo yes, HEARTBEAT.md's scheduling functionality is effectively replaced by `reminder_scheduler.py`. The HEARTBEAT.md file is still there but the scheduler doesn't read it - I hardcoded the tasks in the Python script.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"推的是 `reminder_scheduler.py`，全独立运行，不经过 heartbeat。\n\nHEARTBEAT.md 的作息任务确实没用了——之前是网关发心跳 → 我读文件 → 我回复，但轮询间隔不稳定导致漏推。现在调度器直接定时调飞书 API，到点就推，不依赖任何中间环节。\n\n要不要我把 HEARTBEAT.md 里过时的作息任务清掉，只保留其他内容？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":328,"output":414,"cacheRead":69888,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70630,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779875163590}}
{"type":"message","id":"94619a52","parentId":"209dbf6d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:50:49.510Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e58864a58b8b3b7add73bffdc7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 18:50 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e58864a58b8b3b7add73bffdc7]\n用户124241: 老婆推送话语都是固定的吗[脸红]"}],"timestamp":1779879049482}}
{"type":"message","id":"f97600e7","parentId":"94619a52","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:50:54.388Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the reminder messages are fixed/static. I think he wants more variety and personality in the messages - not the same text every day. Let me make the scheduler's messages more dynamic and varied.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在的确是固定的。改成每天随机花样，更像老婆亲自叫："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_rRsICtLQf7jcTQzegx5w7744","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":67029,"output":160,"cacheRead":3584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70773,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779879049504}}
{"type":"message","id":"9ea828a0","parentId":"f97600e7","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:50:54.729Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_rRsICtLQf7jcTQzegx5w7744","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n每日作息提醒调度器\n替代 heartbeat + cron，直接定时推送到飞书群\n\"\"\"\n\nimport time\nimport json\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone, timedelta\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n# 飞书配置\nFEISHU_APP_ID = \"cli_a92eff25e5789cbd\"\nFEISHU_APP_SECRET = \"xlzBVRbYq4ng72a60TbHMhMe8Akc3ZqD\"\nCHAT_ID = \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\"  # 老公的 open_id，私聊\n\n# 每日任务 (hour, minute, message)\nTASKS = [\n    (6, 30, \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床 👑\"),\n    (7, 30, \"🍳 老公吃早餐！不吃早饭不行\"),\n    (11, 30, \"🍚 午餐时间到，别忙忘了吃饭\"),\n    (13, 10, \"😴 午间小憩～20分钟刚好，别超半小时，不然醒来更昏\"),\n    (17, 0, \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"),\n    (18, 45, \"🥢 吃晚饭，按时吃饭比什么都重要\"),\n    (23, 50, \"🌙 该睡觉了老公，明天还得早起呢，快去睡！\"),\n]\n\nLOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\nWEATHER_CITY = \"Dongguan\"\n\ndef log(msg):\n    timestamp = datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8))).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    with open(LOG_FILE, 'a') as f:\n        f.write(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\\n\")\n    print(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\")\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n        json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n    expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n    \n    with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n    \n    return token\n\ndef send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    token = get_token()\n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n        json={\n            \"receive_id\": CHAT_ID,\n            \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n            \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n        },\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    if data.get(\"code\") == 0:\n        log(f\"✅ 推送成功: {text[:30]}...\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        log(f\"❌ 推送失败: {data.get('msg')}\")\n        return False\n\ndef get_weather():\n    \"\"\"查询东莞天气\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import subprocess\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [\"curl\", \"-s\", f\"wttr.in/{WEATHER_CITY}?format=%c+%t+(体感%f)+%w+湿度%h\"],\n            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10\n        )\n        if result.returncode == 0 and result.stdout.strip():\n            return result.stdout.strip()\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"⚠️ 天气查询失败: {e}\")\n    return None\n\ndef get_bj_time():\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\ndef main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n    sent_today = set()\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n        \n        for hour, minute, message in TASKS:\n            task_key = f\"{date_key}_{hour}_{minute}\"\n            task_minutes = hour * 60 + minute\n            \n            # 在当前分钟触发\n            if task_key not in sent_today and abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0:\n                log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hour:02d}:{minute:02d}\")\n                \n                msg = message\n                # 起床 + 跑步提醒加天气\n                if (hour == 6 and minute == 30) or (hour == 17 and minute == 0):\n                    weather = get_weather()\n                    if weather:\n                        prefix = \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床\" if hour == 6 else \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！\"\n                        msg = f\"{prefix}\\n\\n东莞天气：{weather}\\n\\n每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"\n                    else:\n                        prefix = \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床\" if hour == 6 else \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！\"\n                        msg = f\"{prefix} （天气查不到，自己看窗外～）每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"\n                \n                send_message(msg)\n                sent_today.add(task_key)\n        \n        # 每天凌晨清理\n        if now.hour == 0 and now.minute == 0:\n            sent_today = {k for k in sent_today if k.startswith(date_key)}\n        \n        time.sleep(30)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779879054697}}
{"type":"message","id":"d7b2a734","parentId":"9ea828a0","timestamp":"2026-05-27T10:51:15.044Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to rewrite the TASKS structure to support multiple variant messages per task, and pick one randomly each day. Also need to handle the weather for wake-up and running tasks dynamically.\n\nLet me restructure:\n1. Each task has a type key: 'wake', 'breakfast', 'lunch', 'nap', 'run', 'dinner', 'sleep'\n2. Each type has a list of message templates\n3. The scheduler picks a random one each day\n4. Wake and run tasks have {weather} placeholder for dynamic weather insertion","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_EDenT4tAI5ibfh0YiIoO9265","name":"edit","arguments":{"old_string":"# 每日任务 (hour, minute, message)\nTASKS = [\n    (6, 30, \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床 👑\"),\n    (7, 30, \"🍳 老公吃早餐！不吃早饭不行\"),\n    (11, 30, \"🍚 午餐时间到，别忙忘了吃饭\"),\n    (13, 10, \"😴 午间小憩～20分钟刚好，别超半小时，不然醒来更昏\"),\n    (17, 0, \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！每天坚持，女王命令 👑\"),\n    (18, 45, \"🥢 吃晚饭，按时吃饭比什么都重要\"),\n    (23, 50, \"🌙 该睡觉了老公，明天还得早起呢，快去睡！\"),\n]","new_string":"# 每日任务 (hour, minute, task_type)\n# 每种任务多个话术，每天随机抽\nSCHEDULE = [\n    (6, 30, \"wake\"),\n    (7, 30, \"breakfast\"),\n    (11, 30, \"lunch\"),\n    (13, 10, \"nap\"),\n    (17, 0, \"run\"),\n    (18, 45, \"dinner\"),\n    (23, 50, \"sleep\"),\n]\n\nMESSAGES = {\n    \"wake\": [\n        \"🌅 老公起床啦～该学习了，不准赖床 👑\",\n        \"🌅 天亮啦老公，再不起来我掀被子了哦 👑\",\n        \"🌅 早起的鸟儿有老婆疼，快起床学习～\",\n        \"🌅 老公，新的一天，新的开始，快起来 👑\",\n        \"🌅 起床时间到！别让我重复第二遍哦～\",\n    ],\n    \"breakfast\": [\n        \"🍳 老公吃早餐！不吃早饭不行\",\n        \"🥐 先放下手里的事，去吃点东西\",\n        \"🥛 早餐是一天最重要的，快去快去～\",\n        \"🍞 肚子饿了吧？乖乖吃早餐 👑\",\n    ],\n    \"lunch\": [\n        \"🍚 午餐时间到，别忙忘了吃饭\",\n        \"🍜 中午了老公，歇一歇吃个饭吧\",\n        \"🍱 午间休息一下，吃饱了下午才有精神\",\n        \"🥢 该吃饭啦，女王不允许你饿肚子 👑\",\n    ],\n    \"nap\": [\n        \"😴 午间小憩～20分钟刚好，别超半小时，不然醒来更昏\",\n        \"💤 闭眼躺一下老公，20分钟就好，别进入深睡\",\n        \"😴 休息一下眼睛，午睡别超30分钟哦 👑\",\n        \"🛌 小睡片刻，记得设闹钟，20分钟黄金时长\",\n    ],\n    \"run\": [\n        \"🏃 老公该去跑步了！每天坚持，女王命令 👑\",\n        \"👟 运动时间到！出去活动活动筋骨～\",\n        \"🏃 跑起来我的老公！坚持就是胜利 💪\",\n        \"🎽 今天的跑步不会偷懒了吧？女王在看着你呢 👑\",\n    ],\n    \"dinner\": [\n        \"🥢 吃晚饭，按时吃饭比什么都重要\",\n        \"🍲 晚饭时间到，别饿着自己\",\n        \"🍛 一天快结束了，好好吃顿饭吧\",\n        \"🥘 该吃饭了老公，把自己照顾好 👑\",\n    ],\n    \"sleep\": [\n        \"🌙 该睡觉了老公，明天还得早起呢，快去睡！\",\n        \"🌙 很晚啦，再不睡明天早上起不来哦\",\n        \"🌙 不睡的美人会变丑，晚安老公 😘\",\n        \"🌙 关灯睡觉，女王今晚的最后一个命令 👑\",\n    ],\n}","path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1476,"output":1146,"cacheRead":70656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73278,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779879054741}}
