{"type":"message","id":"3a8b5fe1","parentId":"ba0e6d47","timestamp":"2026-05-27T15:52:43.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is worried that switching to flash model will make me \"dumber\" or less natural in conversation. This is a valid concern - flash models are typically smaller/faster and may have somewhat degraded quality compared to pro models.\n\nLet me be honest about this. Flash is generally good at simple tasks but may be slightly less nuanced in complex reasoning. However, for everyday chat, the difference might not be that noticeable. Let me give an honest assessment.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话，会有点差异：\n\n- Flash 响应快、便宜，日常闲聊基本够用\n- 但复杂推理、长上下文、细节记忆不如 pro\n- 你今天跟我聊了一整天，能感觉到的那种\"懂你\"的程度，pro 确实更好\n\n不过我们有兜底：聊着觉得我不够聪明了，随时 `/model deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro` 秒切回来。重启后先试试，不爽就回去 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":390,"output":279,"cacheRead":101760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102429,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779897156967}}
