{"type":"message","id":"3ddfd9b3","parentId":"1b7647e7","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:03:03.780Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a pre-compaction memory flush. I need to write durable memories from this session to `memory/2026-05-28.md`. Let me check if it exists first, then append.\n\nKey things to remember from this session (which started as May 27 evening and crossed into May 28):\n\n1. **Clash config updates for crypto news**: Created CRYPTO-NEWS proxy group routing coindesk.com/coingecko.com through JP-Tokyo-01, KR-Home-01 nodes\n2. **CoinDesk/CoinGecko connectivity**: Fixed via CRYPTO-NEWS proxy group, both sources now accessible\n3. **GitHub private repo push**: Pushed complete workspace (~326 files, 81MB) to github.com/yuki39lhl-huang/Morgan.git\n4. **Model strategy**: Default changed to deepseek-v4-flash, spawn pro sub-sessions for code modifications, monitor AI stays on pro\n5. **Reminder scheduler**: Created `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py` for daily schedule push notifications to private chat\n6. **Weather integration**: Added Dongguan weather to 6:30 wake-up and 17:00 running reminders\n7. **Randomized messages**: Each reminder has 4-5 variant messages, randomly chosen daily\n8. **Push testing**: Test cron at 14:35 didn't fire (OpenClaw cron system issue), replaced with independent Python scheduler\n9. **Positions summary for May 27**: Started 4 shorts (SOL $84.08, DOT $1.253, ETH $2072, LINK $9.421), ended with -$5.64 net loss. DOT near SL multiple times but held.\n10. **DOT stop loss risk**: DOT hit $1.273, SL at $1.278, consistently the most volatile holding\n11. **HEARTBEAT.md cleanup**: Scheduling tasks moved from HEARTBEAT.md to reminder_scheduler.py, heartbeat system no longer used for time-sensitive reminders\n12. **GitHub token**: Token `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` was shared in chat, should recommend revocation","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type"