{"type":"message","id":"00d57f16","parentId":"322d7de0","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:06:38.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the issue is clear. The monitor DID try to take profit on BTC, it triggered TP1 at 00:03:52 when price hit $75,359. But Binance rejected the order with `ReduceOnly Order is rejected` (error -2022). It retried 5 times and all failed with the same error.\n\nThis means the position is still open - the monitor tried to close but couldn't. The `ReduceOnly Order is rejected` error suggests the order was submitted as ReduceOnly when there wasn't enough position to reduce, or the position was in ISOLATED mode and something about the order flags was wrong.\n\nLet me check the full log around that time to understand better. Also check if XRP had the same issue.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"触发了，但 Binance 拒单了！让我看看怎么回事："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1HhzuFn7IllMaxS0zDHc7577","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -80 /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log | grep -E \"TP1|止盈|平仓|失敗|拒单|code\" | tail -30","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1164,"output":421,"cacheRead":56576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58161,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779897993756}}
