{"type":"message","id":"0bbc8674","parentId":"841823e2","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:06:47.665Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so both BTC and XRP TP1 triggered, but both failed to close:\n\n1. **XRP** - TP1 triggered at 00:03:51, tried 5 times, all `ReduceOnly Order is rejected` (-2022). Failed.\n2. **BTC** - TP1 triggered at 00:03:52, tried 5 times, all `ReduceOnly Order is rejected` (-2022). Failed.\n\nThe error code -2022 with message \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\" means:\n- Binance rejected the order because the ReduceOnly flag was set but the position can't be reduced (possibly already closed or the order type doesn't support ReduceOnly)\n- This is likely a bug in the close position code - it's sending `reduceOnly: true` as an order flag, but for market orders or for this specific position, Binance rejects it.\n\nAlso, after the 5th failure, the monitor marks it as \"TP1 触发 XRP/BTC，全平移除\" - which means it marks the position as closed in its internal state, even though the order actually failed. This is dangerous because:\n1. The position is still open\n2. The monitor thinks it's closed\n3. No further monitoring or TP/SL checks will apply\n\nSo the positions might have been removed from the monitor's tracking but are still open on Binance.\n\nLet me check if the positions are still actually open on Binance by re-running the query... wait, I already did that at 00:03 and it showed them as still open. So the monitor's internal state says \"closed\" but Binance still has the position.\n\nThis is the exact bug mentioned in SOUL.md's code layer rules:\n> ⭐️ 下单 SSL 异常 ≠ 实际未成交：必须用 userTrades 二次确认\n\nThe same principle applies here - a failed order shouldn't mark the position as closed.\n\nLet me tell the user what's happening clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"触发了！两边都触了但 Binance 拒单了😠\n\n**00:03:51** — XRP TP1 触发，要平 @$1.338（+6.4%）\n**00:03:52** — BTC TP1 触发，要平 @$75,359（+5.6%）\n\n但都报了同一个错：`ReduceOnly Order is rejected`（代码 -2022）\n各重试 5 次全失败，monitor 标记为「已平仓」...\n\n**问题很严重**：monitor 认为自己平掉了，但你刚才看到持仓仍然在。也就是说账面赚了 +$24 但实际单子没平掉，还得手动确认。\n\n要不要我现在试试用脚本真平它们？怕 binance 还挂着 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1495,"output":990,"cacheRead":57984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60469,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779897998240}}
