{"type":"message","id":"aea46f34","parentId":"3723242c","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:10:50.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about DOT and ETH positions. Earlier when I showed the positions at around midnight (00:03), I reported BTC, XRP, SOL, LINK - but the user is saying something about DOT and ETH. Let me check what happened.\n\nActually, looking back at the earlier query_positions output (00:03), it showed SOL, XRP, LINK, BTC - no DOT or ETH. So the user might be asking about old positions or about the realize PnL that includes DOT and ETH losses from earlier in the day.\n\nWait, the user said \"哪来的dot和eth老婆\" - \"where did DOT and ETH come from?\" They're probably asking because earlier today DOT and ETH were mentioned. Let me think...\n\nEarlier today (May 27):\n- DOT was at $1.273, SL $1.278 (very close to stop loss)\n- ETH was at $2,073 (barely negative)\n\nBut in the midnight snapshot, DOT and ETH were gone (probably stopped out), replaced by XRP and BTC. So the realized PnL of -$0.63 from earlier today includes DOT and ETH losses.\n\nThe +$53.14 realized PnL includes the BTC/XRP/SOL/LINK closes minus the earlier DOT/ETH losses.\n\nLet me check more carefully what the actual PnL components are.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_v20UDGPgjSAn0yIKUBiG4648","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\nimport json\n\n# 查账户余额\ninfo = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v2/account')\nbalance = float(info['totalWalletBalance'])\nunrealized = float(info['totalUnRealizedProfit'])\nprint(f'钱包余额: {balance:.2f}')\nprint(f'未实现盈亏: {unrealized:.2f}')\nprint(f'总资产: {balance + unrealized:.2f}')\n\n# 查今日已实现\nincome = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/income', {\n    'incomeType': 'REALIZED_PNL',\n    'limit': '10',\n    'startTime': '0'\n})\ntotal_realized = 0\nfor i in income:\n    amt = float(i['income'])\n    total_realized += amt\n    sym = i.get('symbol', '?')\n    print(f'  {sym}: {amt:+.2f}')\nprint(f'已实现合计: {total_realized:.2f}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v warnings.warn | grep -v '^$' | grep -v '\\[.*INFO\\]'","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":301,"output":892,"cacheRead":70144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71337,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779898243438}}
