{"type":"message","id":"a96163c4","parentId":"53b3f28a","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:16:31.174Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying:\n- They see the PnL now\n- But the Testnet wallet is still showing 5037 USDT\n- Adding $53 should make it ~5050\n- They realize they were wrong and apologize\n\nLet me think about this... The wallet balance of 5037.70 is the total wallet balance including all time PnL, not just today's. The original balance might have been different. Testnet often starts accounts with different amounts. The REALIZED_PNL from the income history shows today's trades only (+$55.41).\n\nActually, the wallet shows \"5037.70\" but the income history (which only goes back a limited amount) shows +$55.41. There might have been earlier realized PnL that we're not seeing because of the LIMIT 20.\n\nBut wait - maybe the original balance was closer to 4982 or something, and adding the +$55 gives 5037. Or maybe there were also losses earlier that aren't in the recent income history.\n\nLet me check the total PnL from the account info to explain.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_CHr8A3AGSN1ejtIG70Cy2031","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\ninfo = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v2/account')\nbalance = float(info['totalWalletBalance'])\nupnl = float(info['totalUnrealizedProfit'])\nmargin = float(info['totalMarginBalance'])\nprint(f'钱包余额: {balance:.2f} USDT')\nprint(f'未实现: {upnl:.2f} USDT')\nprint(f'总权益: {margin:.2f} USDT')\n\n# 查所有历史已实现（不限条数）\nincome = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/income', {\n    'incomeType': 'REALIZED_PNL',\n    'limit': '100'\n})\ntotal = sum(float(i['income']) for i in income)\nprint(f'全部历史已实现: {total:.2f}')\nprint(f'推测初始金额: {balance - total:.2f}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v InsecureRequestWarning | grep -v warnings.warn | grep -v '^$' | grep -v '\\[.*INFO\\]'","timeout":15}}],"