{"type":"message","id":"bb02f44b","parentId":"3045b341","timestamp":"2026-05-27T16:25:29.777Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to fix both bugs and then open a new test position. Since this involves code modification, according to SOUL.md rules I need to spawn a pro sub-agent.\n\nLet me spawn a pro sub-agent to fix the bugs and possibly open a test trade.\n\nActually, let me think about what needs to be done:\n\n1. Fix `close_all_positions()` in `binance_auto_trade.py` - add USDT suffix back\n2. Fix `place_order()` or `close_all_positions()` - the reduceOnly issue for shorts\n\nFor bug #1, looking at line 349:\n```python\nsymbol = pos['symbol']\n```\nThis gets \"SOL\" from the position, but then passes it to `place_order()` which expects \"SOLUSDT\".\n\nFor bug #2, looking at line 431-433 in `place_order()`:\n```python\nif reduce_only:\n    order_params[\"reduceOnly\"] = \"true\"\n```\nThis sends `reduceOnly: \"true\"` to Binance. But Binance rejected it with \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\". For manual closing, we probably don't need reduceOnly since we're closing the full position.\n\nLet me spawn a pro sub-agent for this work since it involves modifying code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_qad9d17KM1jQWZmPj1uN2813","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"修改 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py`，修复两个 bug：\n\n**Bug 1 — `close_all_positions()` (line 349) 传的 symbol 缺 USDT 后缀**\n当前代码：\n```python\nsymbol = pos['symbol']  # 拿到的是 \"SOL\" 不是 \"SOLUSDT\"\n```\n修复：传给 `place_order()` 时加回 USDT 后缀\n```python\nsymbol = pos['symbol'] + \"USDT\"\n```\n\n**Bug 2 — reduceOnly 被 Binance Testnet 拒单**\n在 `close_all_positions()` 中，调用 `place_order(symbol, side, qty, reduce_only=True)` 传了 reduce_only=True。\n但 Binance Testnet 对 SHORT 仓位平仓时（side=BUY）拒了 reduceOnly flag。\n修复：在 `close_all_positions()` 中调用 `place_order` 时不传 reduce_only（即去掉 reduce_only=True，或者改为 False）。\n\n这两个改动都很小，改完检查一下格式没问题就行。\n\n改完后还要做：\n3. 用 `manual_trade.py` 开一单测试：`python3 manual_trade.py open SOL SHORT 20 10 --confirm`（保证金20 USDT，10x杠杆）\n4. 验证开仓成功\n5. 然后用 `manual_trade.py close SOL --confirm` 平仓，验证平仓不再报错\n\n重要：修改完代码后不需要重启任何服务，直接执行 python 命令即可。","mode":"run"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":488,"output":912,"cacheRead":79104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80504,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779899120915}}
